ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/029ec928df04d6a4fdd51db04056739ae4957132/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:59:37Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:59:37Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"message":"feat(aplicacion-pagos): pantalla de carga del MAESTRO\n\nPrimera pantalla de la App «Aplicación de Pagos» (Recaudos). El MAESTRO lo\narma un script de Calidad que corre en local sin alcance al backend, así que\nun usuario lo sube desde aquí con su sesión:\n\n- Subir el Excel (clic o arrastrar) y ver el resumen: leídos, cargados, ya\n  estaban (ID_Registro repetido, no se duplica), por revisar (parecidos a\n  otro pago) y errores fila por fila con su origen (Alma o el script).\n- Historial de cargas; clic en una con errores los despliega.\n- La App entra al catálogo (permiso app.recaudos-aplicacion-pagos.view).\n- ApiService.upload para POST multipart.\n\nRequiere SkCo-Dali/alma-backend#209 y las migraciones 044, 045 y 047.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e94dfba1c5a22ac67653e6ea394427705c02a999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/e94dfba1c5a22ac67653e6ea394427705c02a999"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/029ec928df04d6a4fdd51db04056739ae4957132","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":