com/users/ysoydaniel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/44a93684f754bd4c61302658490a0ad9f53b01da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T15:28:00Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:53:59Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"message":"chore(launcher): quitar de Alma las Apps que no están en uso\n\n- Cinco maquetas sin backend ni URL real: Bandeja de Emisión, Control\n  Documental, Pharos Consulta, Dashboard Operaciones y Salesforce Hub.\n- Cheques: sin uso en prd (0 cheques, 0 usuarios con rol). Sale del\n  catálogo, su ruta, el acceso «Buscar un cheque» del Home y su tarjeta de\n  métricas, y se borra su pantalla. El API del backend se conserva.\n- Usuarios SAC: sale del catálogo y de las novedades del Home. La\n  infraestructura de micro-frontends (host y configuración por ambiente) se\n  deja para las Apps de otros equipos.\n\nRequiere SkCo-Dali/alma-backend#187 (migración 043).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 23df17eb3c457d337d12d5cb6a2d95a33fc8c3b5)","tree":{"sha":"da0faa7e0438b4faf687291173f6388593c3210d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/da0faa7e0438b4faf687291173f6388593c3210d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/44a93684f754bd4c61302658490a0ad9f53b01da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215194005?