ydaniel","node_id":"U_kgDODNOZlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/d4cd0bcc8863b4d65e429d0f7486dff1ee14f28c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:12:52Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:53:58Z","email":"danielcashij@gmail.com","name":"ysoydaniel"},"message":"fix(auth): el usuario de prueba ya no viaja en el código de dev, stg y prd\n\nHallazgo 5 del retest de 7Way: el bundle de producción traía el usuario mock\nde desarrollo con todos los permisos de plataforma (platform.admin,\nplatform.access.assign…), que era la lista más reveladora de la estructura\nde permisos.\n\n- El usuario pasa a src/app/core/auth/usuario-local.ts y SOLO lo importa\n  environment.ts (local). Los builds por ambiente reemplazan ese archivo, así\n  que no llega a su bundle. Verificado en el build de producción: 0\n  apariciones.\n- Sin sesión en dev/stg/prd, el usuario es uno vacío, sin roles ni permisos\n  (antes era el mock con permisos de admin mientras cargaba el login).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 419a02a33a19d941844b1934fac8058fe697534d)","tree":{"sha":"b6b1acf095dd94320910c902b589837de588f664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/b6b1acf095dd94320910c902b589837de588f664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/d4cd0bcc8863b4d65e429d0f7486dff1ee14f28