oducción traía el usuario mock\nde desarrollo con todos los permisos de plataforma (platform.admin,\nplatform.access.assign…), que era la lista más reveladora de la estructura\nde permisos.\n\n- El usuario pasa a src/app/core/auth/usuario-local.ts y SOLO lo importa\n  environment.ts (local). Los builds por ambiente reemplazan ese archivo, así\n  que no llega a su bundle. Verificado en el build de producción: 0\n  apariciones.\n- Sin sesión en dev/stg/prd, el usuario es uno vacío, sin roles ni permisos\n  (antes era el mock con permisos de admin mientras cargaba el login).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6b1acf095dd94320910c902b589837de588f664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/b6b1acf095dd94320910c902b589837de588f664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/419a02a33a19d941844b1934fac8058fe697534d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215194005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ysoydaniel","id":215194005,"login":"ysoydaniel","node_id":"U_kgDODNOZlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel","user_view_type":"