a4246","sha":"44fbe7d4d1985006ad01c289df21bd8d3a4a4246","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/44fbe7d4d1985006ad01c289df21bd8d3a4a4246"}],"sha":"f0f884a8aca4de8d174ac57b0ac6bcc6b0cf65ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/f0f884a8aca4de8d174ac57b0ac6bcc6b0cf65ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222491069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CristianCardenas-Sk","id":222491069,"login":"CristianCardenas-Sk","node_id":"U_kgDODULxvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commits/44fbe7d4d1985006ad01c289df21bd8d3a4a4246/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:21:17Z","email":"ccardenas@skandia.com.co","name":"Cardenas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:21:17Z","email":"ccardenas@skandia.com.co","name":"Cardenas Rodriguez"},"message":"fix(comisiones): el combo de tipo de comisión solo acepta planes de la lista\n\nEn Contabilidad y Tipos de Comisión el combo \"Tipo Comisión\" dejaba escribir\ncualquier texto y lo guardaba como valor (\"Puedes dejar el texto escrito\"),\ny de ese texto se calculaban producto, abreviación y nombre contable.\n\nNueva opción soloOpciones del combo: lo escrito solo filtra la lista y el\nvalor cambia únicamente al elegir un plan. Al cerrar la lista, hacer clic\nfuera o salir con Tab, el campo vuelve a mostrar el plan elegido. Al editar\nse conserva el plan guardado aunque no esté en la lista. \"Regla\" en Ajustes\nsigue permitiendo texto libre.\n\nEl backend ya rechaza (422) un tipo que no sea un plan real; esto evita\nllegar hasta ahí desde la pantalla.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ed5715f4a0dd9e7bda0a544d48702b508300213","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/5ed5715f4a0dd9e7bda0a544d48702b508300213"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/44fbe7d4d1985006ad01c289df21bd8d3a4a4246","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222491069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CristianCardenas-Sk","id":222491069,"login":"CristianCardenas-Sk","node_id":"U_kgDODULxvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/subscriptions"