0:00:47Z","email":"ccardenas@skandia.com.co","name":"Cardenas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:00:47Z","email":"ccardenas@skandia.com.co","name":"Cardenas Rodriguez"},"message":"fix(comisiones): combos de plan con todos los publicados y listos para aprobar\n\nLos selectores de plan de Parametrización (Tipo Comisión en Contabilidad y\nTipos, y Regla en Ajustes) solo cargaban la primera página de 200 planes\npublicados. Hay 546 publicados, y los productos cargados por script (MFUND…)\nquedan en \"listo para aprobar\", así que no se les podía crear contabilidad\ndesde la pantalla.\n\nAhora se traen todas las páginas de published y ready_to_approve, los mismos\nestados que el backend acepta para parametrizar. Un nombre repetido se\nmuestra una vez; si existe publicado y en revisión, gana el publicado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7d9d03211c04441cd377d34c9881d53fa7ccd9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/d7d9d03211c04441cd377d34c9881d53fa7ccd9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/95b41c2700a47c6c4dc7d950b8033eb6b777ede9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222491069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CristianCardenas-Sk","id":222491069,"login":"CristianCardenas-Sk","node_id":"U_kgDODULxvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-