día convertirse en tres, justo lo que el\nhallazgo de 7Way pide evitar. Ahora la descarga se intenta una vez y, si\nfalla, el usuario ve el motivo del backend (429/503) y decide.\n\nEl backend exige compañía y periodo (Comisiones) o periodo y segmento\n(Correos) para descargar. Como las pestañas abren con filtros en blanco, el\nbotón queda deshabilitado con un aviso hasta tenerlos, en vez de dar un 400.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"718eb201efab091a557d1bc543fd4a6004edaed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/718eb201efab091a557d1bc543fd4a6004edaed6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/a13ca44ff37ba4f1b4186c25644c0b991232c993","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222491069?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CristianCardenas-Sk","id":222491069,"login":"CristianCardenas-Sk","node_id":"U_kgDODULxvQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CristianCardenas-Sk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-