erse, pero\n  que su configuración e historial se conservan. Ya no pide escribir el\n  nombre: se puede recuperar.\n- Si al crear un buzón la dirección ya había estado en la App, se avisa que\n  se restauró con su configuración y que quedó pausado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit e42e387c99fd444f9564de73c692e12660ec3418)","tree":{"sha":"7a2928993d2d4a1147102eed13c5a8faf80e5b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/trees/7a2928993d2d4a1147102eed13c5a8faf80e5b17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/git/commits/baa48958a45648ffe4089a50ab1cf628cf35daf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215194005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ysoydaniel","id":215194005,"login":"ysoydaniel","node_id":"U_kgDODNOZlQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ysoydaniel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SkCo-Dali/Alma-Frontend-Angular/commit/baa48958a45648ffe4089a50ab1cf628cf35daf2","node_id":"C_kwDOUAE7sdoAKGJhYTQ4OTU4YTQ1NjQ4ZmZlNDA4OWE1MGFiMWNmNjI4Y2YzNWRhZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SkCo-Dali/Alma