red_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/75fc2558a22fb45ac2c3455e5508ff39ddeb1d79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:20:17Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:20:17Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(catalog): Phase 8 — Takshi design system for customer catalog page\n\nRedesigns ShopCatalogPage to match the Takshi Shop reference design:\n- Dark sticky header with centered Playfair Display brand name + gold accent\n- 240px hero carousel with dark gradient backgrounds, grid texture overlay,\n  gold CTA button, and dot indicators in a dark strip below\n- Trust badge strip (4 cols: handloom, craft, shipping, payments)\n- \"Shop by Collection\" horizontal-scroll portrait cards (130×168px) with\n  gradient backgrounds, grid texture, and corner ornament\n- Gold dot + gradient line dividers between sections\n- Gold filter chips (accent border + bg on active) above product grid\n- Product cards: white bg, 162px image area with gradient fallback when\n  no image, gold discount badge (top-left), dark-circle heart (top-right)\n- Full-width dark bottom tab bar (Home / Collections / Search / Call)\n  replacing the old floating pill nav\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"918c4a9a1a7e357659d2d08b24139afc0a5e2de9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/918c4a9a1a7e357659d2d08b24139afc0a5e2de9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/75fc2558a22fb45ac2c3455e5508ff39ddeb1d79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}