/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/3d40ec74ff93d56e1e44f7970cf704982c2f9513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T06:59:24Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T06:59:24Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(catalog): Phase 8 redesign — editorial hero, category chips, shadcn-style cards\n\n- Replace portrait category card grid with horizontal chip strip (thumbnail + name, HMR-style scrollable)\n- Hero: taller (clamp 240–500px), editorial left-aligned text, accent pill badge, shop initials watermark when no images\n- WelcomeSplash: uses hero image as background when available, cleaner layout (no SVG arc ornaments)\n- SectionHeading: left accent bar instead of sparkle ornament, left-aligned on desktop\n- ProductCard: split image Link + footer Link, cleaner footer spacing, rounded-sm discount badge\n- BottomNav: pill-style active tab (primary color fill instead of yellow), refined container shape\n- Remove TrustBadges component (generic filler)\n- Filter panel: inset rounded card, uppercase labels, Clear all button\n- Max-width bumped to 6xl (1280px) for wider layouts\n- All theme CSS vars preserved; TypeScript-clean (0 errors)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c18406d1b08202613145ae5e282d5bddf23d0ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/9c18406d1b08202613145ae5e282d5bddf23d0ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/3d40ec74ff93d56e1e44f7970cf704982c2f9513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/user