 visitor counts + per-piece sold flow\n\nVisitor analytics:\n- customer_events gains device_id (migration c9d0e1f2a3b4). Unique visitors\n  are now counted by the persistent per-browser device id (falling back to\n  the per-tab session id for pre-Phase-7 rows) — a repeat QR scan from the\n  same phone is one visitor, not a new one each time.\n- SHOP_VIEW is de-duplicated within 30 min per session, so navigating back\n  to the grid / refreshing no longer inflates \"Visits\" (now = sessions).\n\nStock / \"Mark Sold\":\n- New PATCH /products/{id}/stock {action: sell|add, count}. \"sell\" decrements\n  quantity and only auto-flips the product to SOLD when it hits 0 — a\n  5-in-stock saree no longer vanishes when one sells. \"add\" restocks (a SOLD\n  product goes live again). Each unit sold is one PRODUCT_MARKED_SOLD\n  activity, so unit-sales analytics stay exact.\n- Products page: the \"Mark Sold\" button is replaced by a \"− N in stock +\"\n  stepper on every card; a separate \"Hide (out of stock)\" toggle for the\n  temporary-unavailable case.\n\n273 backend tests (8 new). Verified in browser: −/+ stepper, auto-Sold at 0,\nrestock brings it back; analytics still loads. Migration up/down/fresh OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"065ccc40794962cc5ea7ca0da0c4a9e52a9037fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/065ccc40794962cc5ea7ca0da0c4a9e52a9037fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/948bf52799ebcca40863e33eaa706ce6b505e556","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://