as/commits/4d38f7eeec149bb3043a26a1255d37e02e6b3add"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/8488780bfc5f6ae498bb9e81c4f2f7df012ba8be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T15:24:14Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T15:24:14Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"fix(admin): dark-mode polish across the shop-owner area\n\nThe owner Dashboard, Categories, Settings, Product form and dialogs were\nbuilt with light-only surfaces, so in dark mode they rendered as white\ncards with near-invisible headings.\n\n- Dashboard KPI cards, Categories cards, Settings shop/contact cards,\n  Product-form card + image manager: add dark: surface + border + text\n- Faint secondary buttons (Edit / Mark Sold / Cancel) get dark: border+text\n- Shared: Badge (all 5 tones), Modal, ConfirmDialog, ErrorState,\n  form input classes — dark variants\n- Page headings: text-neutral-900 → also dark:text-neutral-100\n\nNo behaviour change; Super Admin area is unaffected (it has no dark class).\nVerified in the browser: Dashboard / Categories / Settings / Products all\nconsistent in dark mode. tsc + build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a26963a6fccd9657da0a695acc50c83b819968d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/4a26963a6fccd9657da0a695acc50c83b819968d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/8488780bfc5f6ae498bb9e81c4f2f7df012ba8be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/8488780bfc5f6ae498bb9e81c4f2f7df012ba8be","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDg0ODg3ODBiZmM1ZjZhZTQ5OGJiOWU4MWM0ZjJmN2RmMDEyYmE4YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4","sha":"9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4"}],"sha":"8488780bfc5f6ae498bb9e81c4f2f7df012ba8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/8488780bfc5f6ae498bb9e81c4f2f7df012ba8be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T14:30:45Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T14:30:45Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(billing): Phase 5 — Razorpay Subscriptions (UPI autopay)\n\nBackend:\n- Models: billing_plans (launch plan: monthly-999 / ₹999), subscription_invoices,\n  razorpay_events; shop_billing gains plan_id + razorpay ids + mandate_status +\n  cancel_at_period_end. Migration b8c9d0e1f2a3 (seeds the plan).\n- RazorpayClient — thin httpx wrapper (create/fetch/cancel subscription, ensure\n  plan) + HMAC-SHA256 webhook signature verify. No-ops cleanly when keys unset.\n- subscription service: start / cancel / reconcile; webhook intake is idempotent\n  by x-razorpay-event-id and maps subscription.{activated,charged,pending,halted,\n  cancelled,completed} → SubscriptionStatus; charged writes an invoice.\n- POST /api/webhooks/razorpay (public, signature-gated, always 200 once stored).\n- Daily sweep (app.database.sweep_billing + POST /super-admin/billing/sweep):\n  TRIAL past end / PAST_DUE past grace / CANCELLED past paid_until → EXPIRED.\n- Super Admin: create/cancel/reconcile subscription, list invoices, billing-plans.\n  Owner: GET /billing (read-only) + self-serve POST /billing/subscription + invoices.\n- admin_metrics: real MRR / ARR / revenue-this-month / trial→paid / churn.\n\nFrontend:\n- Owner: BillingCard in Settings (status, plan, \"Set up UPI autopay\", payments)\n  + BillingBanner across the owner area (trial ending / payment failed / expired).\n- Super Admin: Razorpay subscription panel on the shop Billing tab (create opens\n  the authorization URL, cancel-at-period-end, re-sync, payment history).\n\nConfig: RAZORPAY_KEY_ID / _KEY_SECRET / _WEBHOOK_SECRET (documented in\n.env.production.example). Render needs a daily cron running\n`python -m app.database.sweep_billing`.\n\n253 backend tests (23 new). Migration up/down/fresh verified. Webhook flow\nverified end-to-end against a live server + Postgres (signed charged event →\nACTIVE + paid_until + invoice; bad signature → 400).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c99ed339031f6bf38d9adbe94bd7889a2ecf0701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/c99ed339031f6bf38d9adbe94bd7889a2ecf0701"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDllZDc2ZTlkMGE2YzFiOGFkZDY2OGM3MzY2MTE3NTg3NTgyMzY1ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95","sha":"d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95"}],"sha":"9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/9ed76e9d0a6c1b8add668c7366117587582365e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:45:33Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:45:33Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(selection): Phase 4b — guest selection UI + owner Leads\n\nCustomer catalog:\n- useSelection hook (device-keyed shortlist, TanStack Query, instant cache writes)\n- \"＋ Add\" toggle on product cards + sticky \"Add to Selection\" CTA on product detail\n- Floating \"My Selection · N\" bar; new /shop/:slug/selection page —\n  per-item notes, \"show this screen to the shop staff\", no code/QR\n- CustomerContactSheet: bottom-sheet redesign, two unbundled unticked DPDP\n  consents, skip is first-class, one-time per device (localStorage), links\n  the device''s selection to the saved contact\n\nShop owner:\n- New Leads tab (/admin/leads): captured contacts + their picked items,\n  click-to-WhatsApp (wa.me, +91 assumed for bare 10-digit), notes, opt-in filter\n- Analytics: \"Added to Selection\" KPI + \"Most Selected\" products tab\n\nVerified locally end-to-end against seeded data (add → selection → consent →\nlink → owner Leads → analytics). tsc + vite build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b21bfb45f2b08a1e1ecf60a1b1ffa484dd007631","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/b21bfb45f2b08a1e1ecf60a1b1ffa484dd007631"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKGQ2OTVkZjExNDA1YWU0MWU2YWRkZmM2MDQwOGU0ODczZjE3NmFmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7","sha":"29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7"}],"sha":"d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/d695df11405ae41e6addfc60408e4873f176af95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:13:16Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T10:13:16Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(selection): Phase 4a — guest selection list + consent capture\n\nBackend for the \"My Selection\" shortlist a customer builds while browsing\nand shows to shop staff in person, plus the consent popup that turns an\nanonymous device into a follow-up lead.\n\n- Models: selections + selection_items (keyed by a persistent device_id,\n  one per shop/device); customer_contacts gains device_id + two unbundled\n  consent columns (processing / marketing, DPDP Act 2023) + version/at/\n  withdrawn_at. CustomerEventType gains ADD_TO_SELECTION.\n  Migration f6a7b8c9d0e1.\n- Public API (no auth, X-Device-Id header):\n  GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/public/shops/{slug}/selection[/items/{pid}].\n  Adding a product also writes an append-only ADD_TO_SELECTION event so\n  intent is still countable after an item is removed. Cross-shop product\n  → 404, missing device id → 400.\n- POST /contacts extended: requires consent_processing, records marketing\n  consent + version + timestamp, and links the device''s selection to the\n  new contact.\n- Owner: GET /api/shops/{id}/leads (owner-only) — captured contacts newest\n  first with the products they picked + notes.\n- /analytics/rich gains selection_adds KPI + top_selected_products.\n- Frontend plumbing only (no UI yet — that''s 4b): deviceId util,\n  X-Device-Id on publicApi, selection service functions, getLeads, types.\n  The existing contact popup gets the two consent checkboxes.\n\nTests: 233 backend passing (14 new in test_selection_api.py). Migration\nverified up/down/fresh. Frontend builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9f6249a5007b65b5e17559410ae6de5433afdc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/f9f6249a5007b65b5e17559410ae6de5433afdc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDI5ZGE3ZjM1ODM2YzY0MmIyOGE5OGRlZWQ1YThjOGRiZjkwZjVhYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/c7a3ef06b2130d4c280b0874855963342caefd8c","sha":"c7a3ef06b2130d4c280b0874855963342caefd8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/c7a3ef06b2130d4c280b0874855963342caefd8c"}],"sha":"29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/29da7f35836c642b28a98deed5a8c8dbf90f5ab7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/c7a3ef06b2130d4c280b0874855963342caefd8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:53:57Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:53:57Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(charts): Phase 3 — shared chart layer\n\nA small Recharts-based component library, built fresh (not ported) with\nthe data-viz method: form → colour-by-job → validated palette → thin\nmarks → hover-by-default → a11y.\n\n- src/components/charts/: ChartCard (frame + empty state), TrendArea\n  (1–2 series area, legend, crosshair + shared tooltip), BarSeries\n  (4px rounded bars, per-bar hover), BreakdownBars (plain-HTML magnitude\n  bars), Sparkline, KpiTile (number + arrow-and-text delta + sparkline),\n  ChartTooltip. tokens.ts holds the analytical palette — blue s1 / orange\n  s2 / status deltas — as the validated reference-palette steps, light\n  and dark each stepped for their own surface (categorical blue↔orange\n  clears every CVD + normal-vision gate in both modes).\n- Charts are their own visual system (analytical blue), separate from the\n  product''s maroon brand chrome.\n- Owner Analytics page reskinned on the layer: KPI tiles with sparklines,\n  visits TrendArea, sales BarSeries, category + search BreakdownBars.\n- Super Admin dashboard gets a \"New shops\" 12-week signups bar chart;\n  backend admin_metrics.signups_series (IST-bucketed, gap-filled).\n- src/hooks/useDark.ts promoted to a shared hook.\n\nTests: 219 backend passing. Frontend builds. Verified locally light + dark\nwith seeded analytics data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7645bf356166842272c4e2f6417738bb01f1c712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/7645bf356166842272c4e2f6417738bb01f1c712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/c7a3ef06b2130d4c280b0874855963342caefd8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avata