com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/403458fa4b65eabc6e23672df24f01e4d65a898e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:34:10Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:34:10Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(theming): Phase 2 — themeable storefronts\n\nOne dynamic /shop/:slug route renders every tenant from a validated theme\nconfig resolved to concrete tokens. No per-shop page or bundle.\n\nBackend:\n- app/services/theme.py: 6 curated presets (royal-maroon = the current\n  look, plus emerald / rose / lavender / indigo / peach). resolve_theme()\n  turns {preset + overrides} into a flat palette ramp, fonts and layout\n  flags; a stale/unknown preset falls back rather than raising.\n- app/schemas/theme.py: ThemeConfig is strict — extra keys forbidden,\n  colours must be hex, preset must exist, tagline capped. No raw CSS.\n- shops.theme JSONB column (migration e5f6a7b8c9d0); NULL = default.\n- Public GET /shops/{slug} now returns `theme` (resolved).\n- Super Admin: GET /theme-presets, PUT /shops/{id}/theme; shop detail\n  returns theme_config + theme_resolved. ShopCreate takes theme_preset.\n\nFrontend:\n- CatalogThemeProvider writes the ramp to --color-brand-* (Tailwind v4\n  utilities re-theme for free), plus --catalog-* vars and a scoped\n  --color-yellow-* remap so the old gold accents follow the theme;\n  loads the preset''s Google Font pair.\n- ShopCatalogPage + ProductDetailPage wrapped and tokenised; the welcome\n  splash honours splash_style (none/minimal/ornate) and the theme tagline.\n- Admin Theme tab: preset gallery, colour/tagline/splash overrides,\n  swatch preview, \"open storefront\". New-shop dialog gets a theme picker.\n\nTests: 218 backend passing (18 new in test_theme.py). Frontend builds.\nVerified end-to-end locally — switching a shop''s preset re-themes the\nlive catalog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e21f9f6ac979274ed7e269290e0d520f58b0bf63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/e21f9f6ac979274ed7e269290e0d520f58b0bf63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/403458fa4b65eabc6e23672df24f01e4d65a898e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/403458fa4b65eabc6e23672df24f01e4d65a898e","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDQwMzQ1OGZhNGI2NWVhYmM2ZTIzNjcyZGYyNGYwMWU0ZDY1YTg5OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/7a86dc39351fff6dabc53dfc84c46f2afd772b07","sha":"7a86dc39351fff6dabc53dfc84c46f2afd772b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/7a86dc39351fff6dabc53dfc84c46f2afd772b07"}],"sha":"403458fa4b65eabc6e23672df24f01e4d65a898e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/403458fa4b65eabc6e23672df24f01e4d65a898e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/7a86dc39351fff6dabc53dfc84c46f2afd772b07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:39:26Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:39:26Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(roles): Phase 1 — role split + shop billing lifecycle\n\nSuper Admin now owns tenant lifecycle and (soon) revenue only. Catalog\nengagement data — dashboard counts, analytics, the activity feed — is the\nshop owner''s alone.\n\nBackend:\n- New shop_billing table (1:1 with shops): status, trial/paid/grace dates.\n  Migration d4e5f6a7b8c9 creates it, backfills from the old shops columns,\n  drops shops.{subscription_status,trial_start_date,trial_end_date}, and\n  extends the subscription_status enum with PAST_DUE + CANCELLED.\n- Shop.__init__ absorbs the legacy trial kwargs and read-proxies\n  subscription_status/trial_end_date to the billing row, so existing call\n  sites and tests keep working during the transition.\n- app/services/billing.py (replaces trial.py): trial math plus the single\n  is_catalog_live() gate. The public catalog now goes dark automatically\n  when a trial lapses, not just on manual deactivation.\n- app/services/admin_metrics.py: lifecycle/ops dashboard — shops by\n  status, live catalogs, trials expiring <=7d, new shops, dormant shops.\n  Revenue fields stubbed (revenue_pending) until Phase 5.\n- require_shop_owner_self dependency: /dashboard and /analytics* are now\n  owner-only; a Super Admin gets 404. /profile stays accessible to both.\n- Super Admin shop detail returns {shop, billing}; no product stats, no\n  recent_activity. New PATCH /super-admin/shops/{id}/billing for manual\n  status/trial adjustment until Razorpay. ShopCreate takes trial_days.\n\nFrontend:\n- Super Admin dashboard rebuilt around lifecycle/ops with an empty\n  revenue slot for Phase 5.\n- Shop detail → Overview / Billing / Theme (stub) / Access tabs.\n- New-shop dialog gets a trial-length field.\n\nTests: 200 passing. New test_billing.py, test_admin_metrics.py; migration\nverified up/down/fresh against local Postgres 17.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"399b98c23f62680ba2371d99200f341f47f5d369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/399b98c23f62680ba2371d99200f341f47f5d369"},"u