ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/607b978fba4e56ce5f458ca62bf489429e1a62af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:19:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:26:47Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"fix(analytics): use IST (Asia/Kolkata) for all date boundaries and chart buckets\n\nIndian shop analytics were using UTC for period boundaries and chart bucketing,\nmeaning \"today\" started at 05:30 IST instead of midnight IST. This fixes\n_period_bounds() to compute boundaries in IST and converts them to UTC for DB\nqueries, and updates _visits_series()/_sales_series() to use PostgreSQL\nAT TIME ZONE ''Asia/Kolkata'' for IST-aligned date_trunc bucketing.\n\nAdds 12 unit tests covering IST midnight boundaries, cross-day edge cases,\nmonthly/yearly boundaries, and UTC-awareness of all returned bounds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017pFr5jaSa72FXLmR7nwLwP","tree":{"sha":"460f8b056cd9107995535ae6932176563b1a56a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/460f8b056cd9107995535ae6932176563b1a56a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/607b978fba4e56ce5f458ca62bf489429e1a62af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/607b978fba4e56ce5f458ca62bf489429e1a62af","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDYwN2I5NzhmYmE0ZTU2Y2U1ZjQ1OGNhNjJiZjQ4OTQyOWUxYTYyYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981","sha":"1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981"}],"sha":"607b978fba4e56ce5f458ca62bf489429e1a62af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/607b978fba4e56ce5f458ca62bf489429e1a62af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:10:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:26:47Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"fix(analytics): dark-mode charts, composite indexes, New badge\n\n- Fix AreaChart/BarChart Recharts colors: Recharts ignores Tailwind dark:\n  classes on SVG attributes, so colors were hardcoded black (#171717)\n  which became invisible on dark backgrounds. Added useDark() hook\n  (MutationObserver on <html>.classList) and derive line/grid/tick colors\n  reactively — neutral-100/700/500 in dark, neutral-900/200/400 in light.\n\n- Add migration f7a2c891d034: composite (shop_id, created_at) indexes on\n  customer_events and catalog_activity. All analytics queries time-range\n  on created_at; the existing single-column shop_id index forces a\n  full-index scan per time filter at 10k+ rows. Composite index makes\n  period-bounded aggregations O(log n) regardless of total event count.\n\n- DeltaChip now shows \"New\" badge instead of \"↑100%\" when previous = 0\n  and current > 0, satisfying the spec''s empty-previous-period requirement.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017pFr5jaSa72FXLmR7nwLwP","tree":{"sha":"0d66af3b0b3844ce9a7b6fa48192b3dcb0dac599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/0d66af3b0b3844ce9a7b6fa48192b3dcb0dac599"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDFhZDAyYzY4ZTc3OWI0NzBjY2NjYTM0ZDE0YjcxZjNjOGE2OTg5ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e","sha":"0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e"}],"sha":"1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/1ad02c68e779b470cccca34d14b71f3c8a698981"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commits/0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T13:54:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:26:47Z","email":"harshab1104@gmail.com","name":"767508"},"message":"feat(analytics): Phase 7 rich analytics dashboard\n\nBackend:\n- New /analytics/rich endpoint with period selector (today/7d/30d/3m/1y)\n- Period-over-period KPI comparisons (visits, unique visitors, product views, sold)\n- Time-series bucketing via date_trunc (hour/day/week/month)\n- Top viewed + sold products with category join\n- Category performance breakdown with sales_share %\n- Search insights filtered to queries ≥ 3 chars\n- Sales tracked via CatalogActivity.PRODUCT_MARKED_SOLD\n\nFrontend:\n- AnalyticsPage fully rewritten: monochrome premium design\n- KPI cards with ↑/↓ delta chips, period comparison row\n- AreaChart (visits) + BarChart (sales) via Recharts\n- Tabbed top-products (most viewed / most sold)\n- Category performance table + search insights list\n- Dark/Light/System theme toggle in ShopOwnerLayout (persisted in localStorage)\n- Tailwind v4 @custom-variant dark for class-based dark mode\n- date-fns added for bucket label formatting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017pFr5jaSa72FXLmR7nwLwP","tree":{"sha":"8caf22a782ba5acf035ead3fa4a4b38fb0df0c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/8caf22a782ba5acf035ead3fa4a4b38fb0df0c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82608426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11","id":82608426,"login":"ImHarsh11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjA4NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImHarsh11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/0effa97576b2fc2aa9e8282fa7427ae90edd100e","node_id":"C_kwDOUAQopdoAKDBlZmZhOTc1NzZiMmZjMmFhOWU4MjgyZmE3NDI3YWU5MGVkZDEwMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/commit/2f116a7e1721b477c0c644bc79029d20fd30aebd","sha":"2f116a7e1721b477c0c644bc79029d20fd30aebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-sa