e"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:38:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Phase 1: scaffold monorepo with React/Vite/TS frontend and FastAPI backend\n\nSets up the project structure, Tailwind CSS, React Router, TanStack Query\non the frontend; FastAPI app with health-check endpoint, SQLAlchemy/Alembic\nplumbing, and settings management on the backend; plus PostgreSQL dev\ndatabase, env config, docker-compose for local Postgres, and README.","tree":{"sha":"a029034f3a34638b87a56a6a701835d8697c728d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/trees/a029034f3a34638b87a56a6a701835d8697c728d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImHarsh11/digital-catalog-saas/git/commits/0332a13989d1593f29cc74db4d88134f3ae39fc3","verification":{"payload":"tree a029034f3a34638b87a56a6a701835d8697c728d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787240310 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787240310 +0000\n\nPhase 1: scaffold monorepo with React/Vite/TS frontend and FastAPI backend\n\nSets up the project structure, Tailwind CSS, React Router, TanStack Query\non the frontend; FastAPI app with health-check endpoint, SQLAlchemy/Alembic\nplumbing, and settings management on the backend; plus PostgreSQL dev\ndatabase, env config, docker-compose for local Postgres, and README.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFskHsza\nKpiVzYEczvvCVr9ojpRDvWnPirBFsLlVYQAG/vfbRC7IKtpcvRGjLSTtypHlqv6J/vbS+3oq24Yb\noAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-22T04:57:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/c