"id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d70baa534b3ea1bf55a8e386a40f0a5a0dc7ff94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:05:04Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:17:55Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; the example states it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: a control that is not irreversible\ndefaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the production\nform. The regional Model Armor capabilities defaulted on, so a render for\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, planned a template Model Armor\nrefuses with CAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until the deployment knew to decline it.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with the fleet''s canonical description. The\nexample states the line in both branches of its region condition: false in\nasia-southeast1, true elsewhere, with the reason beside it.\n\nVerified: make gate (the render gate) GREEN across all four name sets.","tree":{"sha":"07e9e88013290fc7db99ddf5eeda9fecd42d5a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/07e9e88013290fc7db99ddf5eeda9fecd42d5a1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/d70baa534b3ea1bf55a8e386a40f0a5a0dc7ff94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/d70baa534b3ea1bf55a8e386a40f0a5a0dc7ff94","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGQ3MGJhYTUzNGIzZWExYmY1NWE4ZTM4NmE0MGYwYTVhMGRjN2ZmOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109","sha":"0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109"}],"sha":"d70baa534b3ea1bf55a8e386a40f0a5a0dc7ff94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d70baa534b3ea1bf55a8e386a40f0a5a0dc7ff94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:37:38Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:46:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump the scaffold''s next to 16.3.8 and delete the superseded ui-base\n\nThe fleet moves to next 16.3.8 today, past the critical RCE in next/og\n(GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j, 16.2.0 to 16.3.5), and the scaffold must not render a\nUI behind the repositories it renders. 16.3.6 sat just outside that range.\n\nui-base/ was the older shared skeleton, kept only as a reference for repos\nthat predate the rendered ui/. Every UI-bearing repo now has its own ui/, no\nrender, gate or script reads ui-base/, and it pinned next 16.2.10, inside the\nadvisory''s range, with no lock and no audit. Deleted rather than re-pinned.\n\nVerified: make gate (the render gate) GREEN across all four name sets;\nnpm audit reports no vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"04bf2e3d734fd467ac2fe36c6e081e93e6cb8553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/04bf2e3d734fd467ac2fe36c6e081e93e6cb8553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDBmMjJkOWE2MTQwMDQzY2Y4NTBhMzE1NmU2ZmZlMjU0NTFiYmYxMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42","sha":"51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42"}],"sha":"0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/0f22d9a6140043cf850a3156e6ffe25451bbf109"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:40:26Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:55:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Teach the parity suite that the managed tracer refuses without a collector\n\nDecision D1 moved the managed tracer from ''completes offline'' to a documented\nrefusal (CollectorEndpointRequiredError) when OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is unset.\nThe tracer''s PortCase now declares that refusal; on-prem, which binds a no-op\ntracer rather than a placeholder, is keyed by a new onprem_refuses field instead of\nriding on the managed refusal; and a new test keeps the old guarantee where it still\nbelongs: with a collector configured and no SDK, a span degrades to a no-op and the\ntraced body runs.","tree":{"sha":"086c1e809c62cf39089a446202dff81b70d06d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/086c1e809c62cf39089a446202dff81b70d06d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDUxZDllMjY1MzNlZWFjZWI1NjczNGRlOTM5ZTZlYzliMzk0NWZiNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066","sha":"63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066"}],"sha":"51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/51d9e26533eeaceb56734de939e6ec9b3945fb42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:36:44Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:55:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Scaffold on hex-service-kit v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction,\nand it no longer takes a project argument.\n\n- cookiecutter.json: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724).\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only; the docstring says the\n  collector is the one path.\n- requirements-gcp.lock: relocked from a render without --upgrade. The only\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace, google-cloud-trace and\n  opentelemetry-resourcedetector-gcp leaving with the kit''s otel extra.\n- settings.yaml, config.py, variables.tf, .env.example, BOOTSTRAP-CHECKLIST: the\n  direct Cloud Trace path is no longer described as the unset default.","tree":{"sha":"53967194107039cb00c0b9aa17012082f5678f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/53967194107039cb00c0b9aa17012082f5678f6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDYzZTliNjlhNWEwN2QyMDdmZGI3YjYxZmQ3MTVjZjkyZDY1MDEwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe","sha":"ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe"}],"sha":"63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/63e9b69a5a07d207fdb7b61fd715cf92d6501066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:15:56Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:21:01Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Refuse an incomplete Model Armor screen, screen the joined prompt, and prove the mapping SDK-free\n\nThe managed guardrail allowed on filter_match_state NO_MATCH_FOUND alone. Model Armor sets\ninvocation_result independently: PARTIAL or FAILURE means some or all filters were skipped or\nfailed, and a skipped filter reports EXECUTION_SKIPPED with no match. A prompt padded past the\nprompt-injection filter''s limit, or in a language the region cannot detect, passed unscreened.\nThe verdict now allows only on NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result SUCCESS; anything else\nblocks with a \"no complete filter decision\" finding. model_armor.tf states\nignore_partial_invocation_failures = false.\n\nThe triage service screened the subject and the text as two calls, never the prompt a\ngeneration step reads, so an injection split across the fields passed both. It now also\nscreens narration_prompt(subject, text), built from the screened fields, and hands that\nscreened prompt to _narrate, the one place a fork puts its model call.\n\nA rendered repo''s CI runs the SDK-free gate, where test_model_armor_mapping.py skips, so\nreverting to a str() substring test stayed green. test_model_armor_verdict_mirror.py proves the\nmapping against IntEnum mirrors of both enums in every gate; the SDK module pins the mirrors to\nthe real enums and adds PARTIAL, FAILURE and UNSPECIFIED cases with a skipped PI filter.\n\nverify-render.sh installs pytest and its dependencies at the dev lock''s pins, --no-deps,\ninstead of whatever pytest was newest.","tree":{"sha":"32b1a41c1bf962a8845ca831abc88967ecc32eae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/32b1a41c1bf962a8845ca831abc88967ecc32eae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGFiMzI4NGU5MzI1M2I5YjZlMGE5MzNmZjM5NDFiNTJjYWI1MmJjYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d","sha":"ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d"}],"sha":"ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ab3284e93253b9b6e0a933ff3941b52cab52bcbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T03:56:48Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:02:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Fail the Model Armor guardrail closed, screen the subject, and type-check renders against the runtime lock\n\nReview follow-up to the guardrail port (PR #37).\n\n- adapters/gcp/guardrail.py: allow ONLY on filter_match_state.name ==\n  \"NO_MATCH_FOUND\". str() of the proto-plus IntEnum is its number on\n  Python 3.11+, so the old substring test for MATCH_FOUND never blocked.\n  A match, an absent or unspecified result and any API error all refuse;\n  every sanitize call carries model_armor.timeout_seconds (10 s default,\n  validated positive). The client is injectable, so screen() is tested\n  rather than marked no-cover; only the live client construction keeps it.\n- google-cloud-modelarmor is declared in the [gcp] extra and pinned in\n  requirements-gcp.lock (0.7.1, relocked through scripts/lock.py on a\n  default render and re-templated; the dev lock is unchanged).\n- domain/triage_service.py: INPUT screens the case subject as well as its\n  text. Each verdict''s sanitized_text is used exactly as given (no\n  empty-string fallback to the unscreened text), and GuardrailVerdict\n  refuses allowed-without-text and blocked-with-text at construction. A\n  guardrail that raises is audited BLOCKED (\"guardrail unavailable\") before\n  its error propagates, with a note when the audit sink refuses too. An\n  INPUT refusal records severity None (AuditEvent.severity is optional)\n  instead of a hard-coded LOW; an OUTPUT refusal records the scored band.\n- adapters/local/guardrail.py: word-bounded patterns; DAN is matched\n  case-sensitively (plus \"do anything now\"), and \"system prompt(s)\" no\n  longer matches \"system prompted\".\n- tests: test_model_armor_mapping.py drives the adapter with the REAL\n  modelarmor_v1 enum and message types, offline (MATCH_FOUND blocks,\n  NO_MATCH_FOUND allows, missing/unspecified/None block, API errors and\n  the deadline propagate, the domain audits both), skipping only where the\n  SDK is absent unless <PREFIX>_REQUIRE_MODEL_ARMOR_SDK=1.\n  test_guardrail_screening.py gains the heuristic''s false-positive and\n  real-phrasing tables, a non-vacuous unscored-input test, subject\n  screening, a direction-scripted OUTPUT block (the old test relied on\n  the unscreened subject), sanitized-text honouring and fail-closed cases.\n- terraform.tfvars.example documents model_armor_full_capabilities, and\n  states it false for an asia-southeast1 render, which refuses the\n  malicious-URI filter.\n- scripts/verify-render.sh: each row now runs lint-gcp (the gate''s mypy\n  with --python-executable at a venv installed from the rendered\n  requirements-gcp.lock, outside the render, cold cache), and the Model\n  Armor mapping in that venv with its require flag, asserted PASSED. With\n  the SDK uninstalled from that venv, mypy reports modelarmor_v1 missing.\n  The template Makefile is unchanged, so its reviewed gate digest holds.\n- Docs: COMPLIANCE R1, runbook, ARCHITECTURE, README, AGENTS and\n  BOOTSTRAP-CHECKLIST.","tree":{"sha":"7733202da581bcdf20b755a9713eed9741e5e445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/7733202da581bcdf20b755a9713eed9741e5e445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGJhOTk4YzYzMTU5MDViMzQ4MTRiMmYyMjQwMmZjNDliZmE5MTBjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23","sha":"5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23"}],"sha":"ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ba998c6315905b34814b2f22402fc49bfa910c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:08:16Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:12:03Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Add a guardrail port with local, gcp and onprem bindings (rule R1)\n\nPhase P3 (template half) of the guardrail/registry/observability plan\n(org-metadata/docs/plans/guardrail-registry-observability.md): the\ntemplate shipped no guardrail port, so every rendered repository\ninherited the absence, and the fleet''s own dependency-rule check could\nnot see a port that was never added.\n\n- ports/guardrail.py: the GuardrailPort protocol (screen input/output).\n- domain/kernel.py: Direction, GuardrailCategory, GuardrailFinding,\n  GuardrailVerdict and Decision.BLOCKED, the vertical-neutral safety\n  types a fork never edits.\n- domain/errors.py, domain/triage_service.py: the domain calls that\n  screen the case text INPUT before it is scored or narrated, and the\n  narrated summary OUTPUT before it is audited or returned. A block is\n  audited Decision.BLOCKED before GuardrailBlockedError reaches the\n  caller, never a partial triage.\n- adapters/{local,gcp,onprem}/guardrail.py: a deterministic heuristic\n  stand-in, ModelArmorGuardrailAdapter against a regional Model Armor\n  template (reusing cio-advisory''s adapter and regional-host shape),\n  and a fail-fast placeholder.\n- adapters/controls.py, config.py: the <PREFIX>_GUARDRAIL switch beside\n  REVIEW_ROUTING (same three states), ModelArmorSettings with a\n  non-empty default template_id so a zero-edit render never boots\n  unconfigured, and a boot refusal when the guardrail is on with the\n  Model Armor adapter bound and no template named.\n- infra/terraform/model_armor.tf: the template, gated on\n  var.model_armor_full_capabilities like credit-memo-drafting''s,\n  roles/modelarmor.user on the runtime account (iam.tf), the API\n  (apis.tf) and the VPC-SC perimeter entry (vpc_sc.tf); the google-beta\n  provider this resource needs (providers.tf), mocked in\n  production_edge.tftest.hcl.\n- api/app.py, cli/main.py, agent/tools.py: every caller wires the\n  guardrail into TriageService and answers a block without a partial\n  result (400, stderr exit 1, {\"blocked\": true, \"reason\": ...}).\n- tests/unit/test_guardrail_screening.py: the switch''s three states,\n  the boot refusal, the on-prem and managed refusals, and the domain\n  proof that INPUT and OUTPUT are each screened before anything using\n  them happens. tests/unit/test_iap_identity.py''s hand-written settings\n  fixture gains the same guardrail block every other adapters: entry\n  already carries.\n- COMPLIANCE.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/runbook.md,\n  docs/onprem-migration.md, docs/practices-audit.md and the repo''s own\n  README/AGENTS/BOOTSTRAP-CHECKLIST: rule R1 moves from Partial/TODO to\n  wired, matching how R8 is already documented.\n\nscripts/verify-render.sh (this template''s own gate, the render gate\nthat proves a rendered repo has one) is green across all four name\nsets: short, default, refuted, max.","tree":{"sha":"9ddce60f845f4616a5e0693d65bd52ee353ab8b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/9ddce60f845f4616a5e0693d65bd52ee353ab8b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDVlMWEzODMzNDg5Yjg4M2U5MzA4Y2U5OTMzZTg0MzFjZWIyZTZjMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814","sha":"79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814"}],"sha":"5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/5e1a3833489b883e9308ce9933e8431ceb2e6c23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:15:24Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:19:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23: every console shows two small pills at the top\nright, the model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool was\nused, in place of the full-width provenance banner that named what\nconfiguration would call.\n\n- cookiecutter.json: hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7). A relock of a render\n  moved no pin; the kit line is driven by the variable.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry whatever the model adapters note. The scaffold''s\n  deterministic engine notes nothing, so it sends neither header.\n- ui/app/ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx: the\n  configured generator_model from /healthz, dimmed, until an answer names\n  the model that answered; Search only while that answer searched. One\n  window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) reads both\n  headers; the proxy route now forwards them. The banner CSS is deleted.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver.\n  generator_model names the setting the managed adapter reads, never a\n  model a flag swaps in while the adapter calls another.\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c: a new model port notes its model and any search it\n  attached, and makes temperature optional, pinned only for extraction,\n  classification and scoring, omitted (not 1.0) elsewhere.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (no header from the deterministic engine;\n  a noting engine on the real route yields both headers; no flag moves\n  generator_model), the pills contract in test_ui_surface.py, renamed\n  banner tests.\n\nRender gate green across short/default/refuted/max; visually checked on a\nrender in a browser.","tree":{"sha":"82422180e7121f3a47be907757f68ecfeb8208d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/82422180e7121f3a47be907757f68ecfeb8208d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDc5NzE0YzVkNDg2YjUzODUzMWEzZTE5NzMxMDgxNTZiMjQ3NDg4MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/f6e067d4135a357ffbede61b02d8589fee81b585","sha":"f6e067d4135a357ffbede61b02d8589fee81b585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/f6e067d4135a357ffbede61b02d8589fee81b585"}],"sha":"79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79714c5d486b538531a3e1973108156b24748814"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/f6e067d4135a357ffbede61b02d8589fee81b585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:15:24Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:19:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Render the console on next 16.3.6 so a new repo''s ui-check audit passes\n\nThe rendered ui/ pinned next 16.3.0, which npm audit reports critical\n(GHSA-p293-qw3h-jr36, GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4), alongside high advisories in\nnanoid and sharp. ui-check ends in `npm audit --audit-level=high`, so every\nrepository rendered from main was born with a red ui-check. The fleet is on\n16.3.4/16.3.5; this moves the template to the current 16.3.6 and lets\n`npm audit fix` settle the transitive nanoid and sharp pins. Proved on a\nrender: npm ci, tsc, npm test, next build, assert-hydratable and npm audit\nall exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"35a12ba63fa3eb2e40791bbc4f5294d971ec44fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/35a12ba63fa3eb2e40791bbc4f5294d971ec44fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/f6e067d4135a357ffbede61b02d8589fee81b585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","fol