Q6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/423d6d6bc7fe7075036ca32be73e30682b9d52a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:40:59Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:44:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Render every repo with the live profile and hex-service-kit v0.0.9\n\nA rendered repo is now born with the laptop live profile: every port\nbinds its local adapter, live takes the local posture through\nconfig.LAPTOP_PROFILES (loopback guard, seeded personas, dev CORS,\ndocs), and the banner names the local model once a model port is bound\nunder adapters/live/. The scaffold binds no model port, so the\nCONTRIBUTING port walkthrough now says how to bind one to a kit-backed\nlive adapter over hex_service_kit.localmodel rather than a hand-rolled\nclient. The kit pin moves to v0.0.9 and the exposure matrix gains the\nlive cell.","tree":{"sha":"26446a3329b27a3efe36e5daf7dcedf49719954e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/26446a3329b27a3efe36e5daf7dcedf49719954e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/423d6d6bc7fe7075036ca32be73e30682b9d52a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/423d6d6bc7fe7075036ca32be73e30682b9d52a5","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDQyM2Q2ZDZiYzdmZTcwNzUwMzZjYTMyYmU3M2UzMDY4MmI5ZDUyYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc","sha":"4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc"}],"sha":"423d6d6bc7fe7075036ca32be73e30682b9d52a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/423d6d6bc7fe7075036ca32be73e30682b9d52a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:02:27Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:06:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Scaffold new repositories on review-kit v0.0.2\n\nThe fleet is moving every review-kit consumer from v0.0.1 to v0.0.2, and\na template left behind would make the next scaffolded repository the only\none on the old kit, which portfolio-status section 10 reports as a split.\n\nBoth halves move together: review_kit_version is the tag the rendered\npyproject.toml declares, review_kit_commit is the commit that annotated\ntag resolves to (dec72b6), which the rendered lockfiles pin. v0.0.2 only\nadds an optional bearer_provider parameter to ReviewClient, so the\nrendered adapters are unchanged. The render gate is green on all four\nname sets with review-kit cloned at dec72b6.","tree":{"sha":"78fef4cf1438c2c7026380fee59499dcfea505b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/78fef4cf1438c2c7026380fee59499dcfea505b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDRkMThhYmEzMjRhZjRmNTQ5Y2MwYmM0YmE1OWM3YTk3ZGFjZDhkZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808","sha":"d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808"}],"sha":"4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/4d18aba324af4f549cc0bc4ba59c7a97dacd8ddc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:22:59Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:27:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Generate review routing with a switch, a boot refusal and a reported hand-off\n\nA new repository now starts compliant with the fleet''s runtime-control\ncontract, in the shape the template-shape exemplar (aml-alert-triage) and\nits siblings settled on. Review routing is the one cheap runtime control the\ngenerated service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- <PREFIX>_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states:\n  unset is on, a boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off\n  binds adapters/controls.py''s DisabledReviewRouter and logs one warning per\n  process, however many containers the agent tool builds.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot instead of\n  failing the first escalation after it was scored and audited.\n- The API, the agent tool and the CLI hand off through RecordingReviewRouter,\n  so a failed hand-off no longer fails the triage: the result carries\n  review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required) and the failure is\n  logged. The console states the outcome in plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it,\n  and relaxes the edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated\n  off; two plan tests hold both directions.\n- Tests that build the app under gcp name a console per module (not in the\n  global conftest, which integration suites read), and the render gate''s\n  real-socket exposure matrix names one for every cell.\n- The runbook documents the switch; SPEC, COMPLIANCE, the practices audit,\n  AGENTS.md, BOOTSTRAP-CHECKLIST, .env.example, settings.yaml, variables.tf,\n  production_edge.tf and tfvars.example no longer say the managed router\n  refuses to swallow an escalation at request time.\n- pii-kit masking protects the audit trail, tool results and the review\n  payload rather than a user''s free-text input, so it gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"226c41bb3717ffd5269d306d95ba3979aec73b6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/226c41bb3717ffd5269d306d95ba3979aec73b6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGQ5N2NjNmRmODAxYTc0MWMzMWQ2MzMxN2YxOTBmM2RiNjU5ZDQ4MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c","sha":"d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c"}],"sha":"d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d97cc6df801a741c31d63317f190f3db659d4808"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:08:26Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:07Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Hold the scaffolded console to its own API\n\nThe console posts the template''s TriageRequest to POST /v1/triage. A repository that reshapes\nthat route or its request model and leaves the console alone ships a console that can never\nproduce a result, and nothing noticed: tsc, the node tests, the build and the hydration check\nall pass over a page that renders. Consoles across the catalog shipped that way, posting\n{subject, text} to routes that took an alert id, a claim id or a question.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) under ui/app/ and fails the\noffline gate unless the path and method are served, every required field of the request model\nis sent, and no field the model would silently drop is sent. Its mutant cases show it red on a\nwrong path, a wrong method, a missing field, an extra field and an unreadable spread body; run\nagainst the fleet it went red on exactly the drifted consoles.\n\nThe call site now says it is the adopter''s wiring point, and the bootstrap checklist says what\nwiring means and which half only a browser run proves.","tree":{"sha":"0c2e8e456e3cace767b483f258a8218da50b5729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/0c2e8e456e3cace767b483f258a8218da50b5729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGQwNGE2NzEwMTRlYzIxOWJhMjU2ZjI5YmY5YTUwYzM4OWUzNDllOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074","sha":"37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074"}],"sha":"d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/d04a671014ec219ba256f29bf9a50c389e349e8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:57:39Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:01:28Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the template on its render gate, in CI and on every pull request\n\nhex-service-template renders every system the fleet starts, and nothing gated it: it was absent\nfrom the reviewed CI contract, carried no caller, and its pull requests reported no check at\nall. scripts/verify-render.sh ran only when somebody remembered it.\n\nWhat makes it gateable by the fleet''s one runner:\n\n- A root Makefile whose `gate` target runs scripts/verify-render.sh. The runner executes only\n  allow-listed make targets, and the contract''s gate_digest hashes this file, so what the job\n  runs cannot move without a re-review.\n- requirements-dev.lock, compiled from requirements-dev.in, pins the one tool the gate needs\n  from its environment: uv (0.12.17), for `uvx --from cookiecutter` and each render''s venv.\n  The runner installs it into the job''s venv; the root has no package, so the contract skips\n  the editable install.\n- .github/workflows/gate.yaml, rendered from org-metadata''s reviewed contract like every other\n  caller: one job, `render-gate`, running `make gate`.\n\nThe one change to what the gate proves: verify-render.sh now installs the four commons at the\ncommits cookiecutter.json pins, cloned fresh, instead of whatever the workspace''s sibling\ncheckouts held. A CI runner has no siblings, and a sibling at main is not what any render ships,\nso the old source made the answer depend on the machine. The clone keeps tags and history for\nthe rendered pin object-type check, and a pin naming a commit GitHub does not have now fails\nhere. COMMONS_GIT_CHECKOUT_ROOT remains as an explicit override for co-developing a commons\nchange; a run that uses it installs those checkouts as they stand and ends by saying it is NOT\nthe gate.\n\nRun the way the runner runs it (a copy of the tree, a python3.14 venv from the dev lock first on\nPATH, no override): all four rows green in 90 seconds, each commons package at its pinned\ncommit, the object-type check 2 passed and the IAP matrix 22 passed in every row. Proved able\nto fail: a 126-column line in a rendered module turns `make gate` red at `make lint` (E501,\nexit 2), and review_kit_commit set to forty zeros turns it red at the checkout (exit 2). The\noverride path, with the commons at main, is green and says it is not the gate.\n\nDocs follow: AGENTS.md, README.md and BOOTSTRAP-CHECKLIST.md describe `make gate`, the pinned\ncommons and the override, and two stale claims go: the template is no longer \"a reusable CI\nworkflow\", and the runner lives in .github/ci/runner, not org-metadata. The rendered\ntest_repo_artifacts.py docstring no longer says the harness uses sibling checkouts.","tree":{"sha":"17b4a80e88da8bfc299656b1487e2b9efc0dcb66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/17b4a80e88da8bfc299656b1487e2b9efc0dcb66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDM3YjQ2ZjAwZmUwMjQ2MGUwZDUwY2E0OTY2ODdmMTZjNjc0ZmEwNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af","sha":"ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af"}],"sha":"37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/37b46f00fe02460e0d50ca496687f16c674fa074"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:44:28Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:12:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Make customer-managed encryption optional, and off by default\n\nEvery binding to the stack''s Cloud KMS key now sits behind cmek_enabled,\ndefault false: the key ring, the key, every grant to a service agent, and\nevery store, log bucket, registry and revision that took the key. Block\nbindings became dynamic blocks; scalar bindings read the key through one(),\nwhich is null when the key does not exist and omits the attribute rather\nthan pointing it at nothing. The Terraform tests that assert on key material\nturn the gate on to keep meaning what they meant.\n\nWhy the default is off: a key ring can never be deleted, a log bucket that\nhas CMEK can never drop it, and registries and document stores take their\nkey at creation. None of that changes an answer or a screen, and everything\nis encrypted at rest with Google-managed keys regardless. A deployment with\na customer whose data it must shred, whose key access must be audited or\nwhose keys must live in an HSM sets it true in its own tfvars BEFORE the\nfirst apply. Where a stack already applied it, the key''s prevent_destroy\nrefuses a plan that omits the line, which is the right answer: the stores it\nbound stay bound.\n\nThe vendored deploy-and-residency-hardening skill says the same.","tree":{"sha":"0d4e307547a8edcf664bca756c81759d7c789a9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/0d4e307547a8edcf664bca756c81759d7c789a9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGVkNjQyZGIwYzY1NjQxMWJlNzQ0NmVhZGFmNjA0ZjA2Y2I4NmU4YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be","sha":"79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be"}],"sha":"ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ed642db0c656411be7446eadaf604f06cb86e8af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:08:37Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:34:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Render the assertion read under both names a request can carry it\n\nThe template rendered an adapter that read the caller''s identity from\n`x-goog-iap-jwt-assertion` and nothing else, so it was the source of the\ndefect rather than another instance of it: every repository it starts would\nhave answered 401 to every authenticated caller the day it was embedded.\n\n`x-goog-*` is Google''s reserved namespace and the serverless frontend strips\nthat whole namespace from a request entering a service, so an embedding host\nbehind IAP cannot forward the assertion its own edge was handed under the\nstandard name. It sends the same value as `x-portal-iap-assertion` as well.\n\nThe rendered read is now the commons selection function, and the rendered\nsuite gains tests/unit/test_embedded_assertion_transport.py, which pins the\ntransport the suite beside it could not see: a test that builds its own\nrequest can only ever choose the header the author had in mind.\n\nscripts/verify-render.sh is green across all four name sets.","tree":{"sha":"3e8aa14a17d12e4750b072381a290192464a92dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/3e8aa14a17d12e4750b072381a290192464a92dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDc5ZDU4NDc1ODFkY2JjMWQzMmJmNjgzZGRkNGZjNzRlZmQ1Y2UyYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1","sha":"13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1"}],"sha":"79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/79d5847581dcbc1d32bf683ddd4fc74efd5ce2be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:44:45Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:46:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the posture paging and the audit-log copy off the reference deployment\n\nThe posture alert policies and their log-based metrics now sit behind\nposture_alerts_enabled, default false. Cloud Monitoring bills every\nmetric-based alert condition, and a reference deployment that pages nobody\nbuys nothing with them; the signals land in Cloud Logging regardless. The\naudit sink routes only this application''s own ledger into its bucket rather\nthan a copy of every Cloud Audit Log entry, which _Default already keeps for\nthirty days. The deployment var file states both decisions.\n\nApplied live to portable-genai-sg by targeted apply on 2026-09-13.","tree":{"sha":"89a9652137a087ae461bce94a7f3c03f91b1758d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/89a9652137a087ae461bce94a7f3c03f91b1758d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKDEzYzc3YzBiZmEyMTY3NjYzZTVlMzI1MTUzZDEwMWNmMzBlYzA3YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4","sha":"ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4"}],"sha":"13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/13c77c0bfa2167663e5e325153d101cf30ec07b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:27:20Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:36:07Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the project audit config, and default it off\n\n`google_project_iam_audit_config` is AUTHORITATIVE for the service it names, so a\nstack declaring `allServices` does not add to the project''s audit configuration,\nit REPLACES it. Forty-eight stacks in this fleet declared it unconditionally and\nfour gated it, which is the collision the posture record already documents as the\nreason those four decline: a stack asking for DATA_READ and DATA_WRITE removes an\nADMIN_READ a sibling enabled, and Terraform reports it as a create rather than a\nchange, because the stack holds no prior state for a resource that is already live.\n\nThis stack now carries `manage_audit_config`, defaulted false. A deployment that\nwants data-access logging names it in its own tfvars, in exactly one stack per\nproject. Data-access logs are also the highest-volume class Cloud Logging ingests,\nand nothing in the reference deployment reads them.\n\nVerified: terraform fmt is clean and terraform validate passes on every touched\ntree; the three Terraform test suites asserting plan-level refusals pass.","tree":{"sha":"e84098853c86afcfdc47251f34726a9f90fd6bc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/e84098853c86afcfdc47251f34726a9f90fd6bc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4","node_id":"C_kwDOUAgFRNoAKGVmMWZlNzE0YjdkODI2MzdkYmE3YTAwNmM2Y2Y0N2QwMzI0YzFhZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commit/8608563ac7904970461ead22c5cbd9aad53c248b","sha":"8608563ac7904970461ead22c5cbd9aad53c248b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/8608563ac7904970461ead22c5cbd9aad53c248b"}],"sha":"ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/ef1fe714b7d82637dba7a006c6cf47d0324c1ad4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/commits/8608563ac7904970461ead22c5cbd9aad53c248b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:10:38Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:12:25Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Scaffold a repo whose WORM lock takes no default\n\nA repository rendered from this template shipped worm_locked = true as a code\ndefault, so its first apply locked an audit bucket for six months before any\ndeployment had chosen to. That is the defect this fleet already paid for\nelsewhere: an unset value may take a reviewed default, but never an irreversible\none.\n\nworm_locked now has no default, so terraform plan refuses with \"No value for\nrequired variable\" until the deployment states it, and the 180-day retention\nfloor binds only when the lock is on, so an evaluation stack may keep a short,\ndestroyable window while a locked one cannot. terraform.tfvars.example states the\nlocked production form active, with posture A spelling out how to decline.\n\nTwo halves of proof. tests/unit/test_irreversible_controls_are_named.py runs in\nmake gate with no terraform binary and asserts the name, the absent default, the\nconditional floor, the variable-not-literal resource, the example and that the\nplan-level suite exercises both postures. production_edge.tftest.hcl states the\nlock once at file level (a run that did not would fail on the missing variable,\nwhich is the refusal itself) and gains two runs for the conditional floor: an\nunlocked stack keeps three days, and nothing keeps zero.\n\nEvery guard was observed failing against a mutated copy of a render first,\nincluding the plan refusing outright when the file-level statement is removed.\n\nThe D5 row''s run count said fourteen and nine; sixteen and eleven now, and the\nnine had already been one short of the ten refusals that were there.","tree":{"sha":"d75c04b0cfd91c1244bbfb843357c6f1440a954f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/trees/d75c04b0cfd91c1244bbfb843357c6f1440a954f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/hex-service-template/git/commits/8608563ac7904970461ead22c5cbd9aad53c248b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/sta