total instead\n  of the pre-discount subtotal\n\nNote: Contracts generated from a discounted Proposal currently\nrecompute their own total from the raw line items and do not inherit\nthe discount.","tree":{"sha":"b7b9e3bbd0068b8043670dd96b4bf584c1f16893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/b7b9e3bbd0068b8043670dd96b4bf584c1f16893"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/commits/769b404e04a831a918aee33b1ccb67d6025aeafb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/769b404e04a831a918aee33b1ccb67d6025aeafb","node_id":"C_kwDOUAg4idoAKDc2OWI0MDRlMDRhODMxYTkxOGFlZTMzYjFjY2I2N2Q2MDI1YWVhZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363","sha":"9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363"}],"sha":"769b404e04a831a918aee33b1ccb67d6025aeafb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/769b404e04a831a918aee33b1ccb67d6025aeafb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:54:50Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:54:50Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"message":"Add Delivery Report tab\n\nAdds a \"Delivery Report\" tab to the Documents generator, positioned\nafter Contract (Proposal → Contract → Delivery Report → Billing\nInvoice → Acknowledgement Receipt → Solar Calculator → OneDrive Files).\n\nDatabase (run database/delivery-report-migration.sql in Supabase):\n- ''delivery'' added as a valid doc_type, with its own numbering sequence\n\nDelivery Report tab:\n- Optional \"Load client/project\" lookup by any saved Quotation/\n  Contract/Invoice number (client, company, project only — no\n  category/template matching needed, unlike the Contract tab)\n- Dedicated item list shaped for deliveries: description, qty, unit,\n  condition/remarks — no pricing columns\n- Delivered-by field, general remarks textarea\n- Prepared by (BIMDEC, with signature) and Received by (free-text\n  client name/position/date, since the client signs for goods\n  received — distinct from the Ack tab''s internal BIMDEC signatures)\n- Own document numbering, print/PDF, Save to records, and Send email,\n  consistent with the other tabs","tree":{"sha":"6e371fd6cc316f9fb83090d5e7b9a5863f1c1941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/6e371fd6cc316f9fb83090d5e7b9a5863f1c1941"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/commits/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363","node_id":"C_kwDOUAg4idoAKDlmYjVjMTAzOTM1MjEwOWIxNWVkNmM3ODU0ODgxYjhlMjRiYTEzNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/2f2b9c492f163062bcd5293b26a6596f7eb9df34","sha":"2f2b9c492f163062bcd5293b26a6596f7eb9df34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/2f2b9c492f163062bcd5293b26a6596f7eb9df34"}],"sha":"9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/9fb5c1039352109b15ed6c7854881b8e24ba1363"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/2f2b9c492f163062bcd5293b26a6596f7eb9df34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:13:13Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:13:13Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"message":"Add Contract tab with quotation lookup and category templates\n\nAdds a \"Contract\" tab to the Documents generator, positioned right\nafter Proposal in the workflow (Proposal → Contract → Billing Invoice\n→ Acknowledgement Receipt → Solar Calculator → OneDrive Files).\n\nDatabase (run database/contracts-migration.sql in Supabase first):\n- documents.category — set on the Proposal tab (Solar Installation /\n  Electrical Design / MEPFS Design Package), saved with the record\n- documents.items — the proposal''s line items, saved as jsonb so the\n  Contract tab can auto-fill its Scope of Work instead of retyping it\n- ''contract'' added as a valid doc_type, with its own independent\n  numbering sequence\n\nProposal tab:\n- New Category dropdown, saved to Supabase alongside the existing\n  client/project/total fields\n\nContract tab:\n- \"Load from Quotation\" — enter a saved Proposal''s Quotation No. and\n  pull its client, company, project, category and line items straight\n  from Supabase\n- Auto-fills the matching boilerplate contract (scope, payment\n  schedule, timeline, warranty, terms & conditions) for the loaded\n  category — all fields remain editable afterward\n- Own document numbering, print/PDF, Save to records, and Send email,\n  same pattern as the other tabs\n\ndb.js: saveGeneratedDocument now stores category/items; added\ngetDocumentByNumber() for the quotation lookup.\n\nNote: the three contract templates are drafted boilerplate, not\nreviewed legal text — needs review before use with real clients.","tree":{"sha":"d5f6d450e19702d32539557eec68ab0dc4a05a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/d5f6d450e19702d32539557eec68ab0dc4a05a95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/commits/2f2b9c492f163062bcd5293b26a6596f7eb9df34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"http