"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/2ba6a00cdca78604bd07c1f191ffbba9242c7ab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:03:23Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:03:23Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"message":"Add Solar Calculator tab to Documents page\n\nAdds a new \"Solar Calculator\" tab to the admin Documents generator\n(frontend/), alongside Proposal / Billing Invoice / Acknowledgement Receipt.\n\n- DocumentMarkup.jsx: new tab button + workspace panel embedding the\n  calculator via iframe (frontend/public/solar-calculator.html)\n- documentsController.js: registers the \"solar\" tab, adds\n  printSolarCalc() (prints the calculator''s recommendation as PDF via\n  its own print flow) and initSolarCalcFrame() (auto-resizes the iframe)\n- documents.css: layout override so the panel renders as a single\n  column instead of the editor/preview grid used by the other tabs\n- public/solar-calculator.html: the calculator itself, with a Deye\n  product line selector (1P/3P Hybrid, 1P/3P Grid-Tie) on the Results\n  tab, sized against confirmed Deye datasheet specs\n\nRenumbers the OneDrive Files tab from 04 to 05 to make room.","tree":{"sha":"74d0f06dabedf6b262b7300d3786be39a0cd1edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/tr