tan","id":23021923,"login":"ldtan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDIxOTIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ldtan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/a2dffcda7c4751beb1e8e43e85aab4a75a7f96e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:20:42Z","email":"liel.onairam.tan@gmail.com","name":"Liel Onairam Tan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:20:42Z","email":"liel.onairam.tan@gmail.com","name":"Liel Onairam Tan"},"message":"Nest the Render services under the bimdec-document-system project\n\nFiles both services into the existing project''s Production environment\nrather than leaving them ungrouped. Render matches projects and\nenvironments by name, and resources defined under `projects:` must not\nalso appear in a top-level `services:` list, so the two service\ndefinitions move rather than get duplicated - their contents are\nunchanged.\n\nAlso ignores frontend/.vite. Vite normally caches in node_modules/.vite,\nbut falls back to a cache directory in the project root under some\nconfigurations; a stale copy there shadows the real one and makes the dev\nserver emit the classic JSX runtime without importing React, which breaks\nthe Documents page in dev only. Production builds were never affected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XvLYXmS9GLtxnrJ5dnMurL","tree":{"sha":"eb39e92b15861310985a0121e0d411a5ee2e12e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/eb39e92b15861310985a0121e0d411a5ee2e12e7"},"url":