s email as a PDF attachment. Authentication and data are backed by Supabase (Postgres + Auth with row-level security); the frontend is a static site on Netlify; a small backend service handles outbound mail (SMTP) and reads incoming replies (IMAP), designed to run entirely on free hosting tiers.\n\nInternal document portal for BIMDEC — admin/client accounts, an invitation-only signup flow, and a generator for proposals, billing invoices, and acknowledgement receipts with built-in email sending. Supabase (auth + database) + Netlify (frontend) + a small backend for SMTP/IMAP.","tree":{"sha":"e03414fb278b9d89676e6d46170122e0683f48a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/e03414fb278b9d89676e6d46170122e0683f48a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/commits/f905268ae1f4fede94c50ed66039f0f97a100099","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/f905268ae1f4fede94c50ed66039f0f97a100099","node_id":"C_kwDOUAg4idoAKGY5MDUyNjhhZTFmNGZlZGU5NGM1MGVkNjYwMzlmMGY5N2ExMDAwOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commit/a5b6b9b831e7f38f9472990d0c5642ba594c9ed7","sha":"a5b6b9b831e7f38f9472990d0c5642ba594c9ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/a5b6b9b831e7f38f9472990d0c5642ba594c9ed7"}],"sha":"f905268ae1f4fede94c50ed66039f0f97a100099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/f905268ae1f4fede94c50ed66039f0f97a100099"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/commits/6b06b6e3891bf679033411d626e4d0a88b64c7db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:28:39Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:28:39Z","email":"baccaljoemel@yahoo.com","name":"kageyama20"},"message":"Migrate auth to Supabase, fix email service bugs, update favicon\n\n- assets/js/db.js: replace localStorage-only prototype with real\n  Supabase Auth + Postgres-backed invites/profiles, so accounts and\n  invite codes work across devices instead of being stuck in one\n  browser''s localStorage\n\n- signup.html: restore invite-code gate, now backed by the\n  validate_invite/redeem_invite RPCs instead of a disabled local check\n\n- login.html, admin/dashboard.html, admin/documents.html,\n  admin/email.html, admin/users.html, client/dashboard.html:\n  load the Supabase client and await the now-async DB.* calls\n\n- backend/src/imapService.js: fix the \"Live\" badge freezing on stale\n  status (connection state changes now broadcast over Socket.IO), and\n  fix a reconnect storm bug where a dropped IMAP connection could\n  trigger multiple overlapping reconnect attempts\n\n- assets/favicon.png: new browser-tab icon from BIMDEC_web.jpeg,\n  wired into all 8 pages (including admin/documents.html, which had\n  an inline base64 favicon replaced with a normal file reference)","tree":{"sha":"acb8e18535d6e8504e1ddad5cd93d04535dab7b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/trees/acb8e18535d6e8504e1ddad5cd93d04535dab7b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kageyama20/bimdec-document-system/git/commits/6b06b6e3891bf679033411d626e4d0a88b64c7db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67349351?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kageyama20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kageyama20","id":67349351,"login":"kageyama20","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MzQ5MzUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us