ed (X-Answered-By) and whether it searched\n  (X-Search-Used).\n- The local narrator notes its stub name; the gcp narrator refuses rather than\n  answering, so it notes nothing. The narration request carries no sampling\n  setting.\n- generator_model no longer honours use_hard_reasoning.\n- ModelPills (top right) replaces ProvenanceBanner; the proxy forwards both\n  answer headers.","tree":{"sha":"701909f6bdc14900c00bd208c59615fbbdf54c49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/701909f6bdc14900c00bd208c59615fbbdf54c49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/f45cef1546c1d3dd3320502b9ae4791c8df9c789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/f45cef1546c1d3dd3320502b9ae4791c8df9c789","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh5hdoAKGY0NWNlZjE1NDZjMWQzZGQzMzIwNTAyYjlhZTQ3OTFjOGRmOWM3ODk","parents":[{"html_