":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/07d7fbcdfcc5f0539a57e689810e511873dce5e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:37:13Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:39:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct docs that say the review router refuses at request time\n\nThe service now refuses to boot under the managed profile when review\nrouting is on and HUMAN_REVIEW_URL is unset, AMLTRIAGE_REVIEW_ROUTING\nswitches routing, and a hand-off that fails at request time is reported\nas review_routing \"failed\" and logged. COMPLIANCE, SPEC, the model card,\nthe compliance FAQ, the practices audit, .env.example and the tfvars\nexample still said the managed router refuses the escalation at request\ntime rather than swallowing it. Documentation only; no verdict changed.","tree":{"sha":"b04320bf3c5da6bb78b8b702acb918424fbf2837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/b04320bf3c5da6bb78b8b702acb918424fbf2837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/07d7fbcdfcc5f0539a57e689810e511873dce5e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/07d7fbcdfcc5f0539a57e689810e511873dce5e3","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh5hdoAKDA3ZDdmYmNkZmNjNWYwNTM5YTU3ZTY4OTgxMGU1MTE4NzNkY2U1ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/109562b09e9052f6c13950e88d631e4f52a428e6","sha":"109562b09e9052f6c13950e88d631e4f52a428e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/109562b09e9052f6c13950e88d631e4f52a428e6"}],"sha":"07d7fbcdfcc5f0539a57e689810e511873dce5e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/07d7fbcdfcc5f0539a57e689810e511873dce5e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/109562b09e9052f6c13950e88d631e4f52a428e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:08:34Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false twice over: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on\nand no console is named, and AMLTRIAGE_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing\noff, so human_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"2899e701fa85fcd800b32a2a8130d44e574a2df6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/2899e7