url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/a2de6e779011cbb3628a086528df2bdc898e1e95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:05:17Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:08:00Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Read console calls with comments blanked\n\nA comment that shows a call is prose. The scaffold''s wiring note quotes the shape a console\ncall should take, and the reader counted it as a call to a path that does not exist.","tree":{"sha":"95246632a8cf190e40a3f28629818fd7a2623260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/95246632a8cf190e40a3f28629818fd7a2623260"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/a2de6e779011cbb3628a086528df2bdc898e1e95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/a2de6e779011cbb3628a086528df2bdc898e1e95","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh5hdoAKGEyZGU2ZTc3OTAxMWNiYjM2MjhhMDg2NTI4ZGYyYmRjODk4ZTFlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873","sha":"445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873"}],"sha":"a2de6e779011cbb3628a086528df2bdc898e1e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/a2de6e779011cbb3628a086528df2bdc898e1e95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:02:36Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:08:00Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Wire the console to the real triage call\n\nThe console posted {subject, text} to POST /v1/triage, but TriageRequest takes only an\nalert_id, so every submit was a 422 and the console could never produce a triage. It now\nreads the persona''s own open-alert queue from GET /v1/alerts and triages the chosen alert\nby id, which is the whole of the request the API takes.\n\ntests/unit/test_console_matches_api.py reads every fetch(API + ...) in ui/app/ and holds it\nagainst the live route table: path and method served, every required field sent, no field\nthe model silently drops. It failed against the old console (missing alert_id, undeclared\nsubject and text) and passes against this one.","tree":{"sha":"fdef3e5e3f2d4ab2134705e622112fa03c270d34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/fdef3e5e3f2d4ab2134705e622112fa03c270d34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh5hdoAKDQ0NWFiZTRmNGVmY2NlYzJmOWVlMjRhZGYzNGQ4MmMzMjQzNGQ4NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63","sha":"82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63"}],"sha":"445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/445abe4f4efccec2f9ee24adf34d82c32434d873"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:50:20Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:53:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, and report every hand-off\n\nTemplate-shape exemplar for the fleet''s runtime-control contract. Review routing is the one\ncheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- AMLTRIAGE_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a\n  boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and\n  logs one warning per process, however many containers the agent tools build.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a\n  500 on the first escalation, after the triage had already been scored and audited.\n- The API, the agent tool and the CLI hand off through a recording wrapper, so a hand-off\n  that fails no longer fails the triage: the response carries review_routing (routed,\n  failed, off, not_required) and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The\n  console states the outcome in plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- pii-kit masking here protects the audit trail, tool results and the review payload rather\n  than a user''s free-text question, so it is not the redaction control the contract\n  switches, and it gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"1b2ab769180b3dbd8687d168d1755d5f95edd712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/1b2ab769180b3dbd8687d168d1755d5f95edd712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh5hdoAKDgyNjQwMTc2YjlhMzk0NWU5MDNjNjllZTdiNjY5MGU5ZTAxNTdiNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commit/2a6e47c63ea23ca227dce8d94420842d84557c7f","sha":"2a6e47c63ea23ca227dce8d94420842d84557c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/2a6e47c63ea23ca227dce8d94420842d84557c7f"}],"sha":"82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/82640176b9a3945e903c69ee7b6690e9e0157b63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/commits/2a6e47c63ea23ca227dce8d94420842d84557c7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:46:43Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:49:05Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"994220f786fa2674fec3731b1c8a0c0e230f26d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/trees/994220f786fa2674fec3731b1c8a0c0e230f26d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/aml-alert-triage/git/commits/2a6e47c63ea23ca227dce8d94420842d84557c7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscription