om/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/52184cc0bba5ff36e19713e928d658208aa52834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:35:52Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:02:19Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.12: GenAI conventions on the model span\n\nv0.0.12 adds gen_ai.operation.name and gen_ai.provider.name to the span\nrecord_token_usage writes, so traces group model calls as the OpenTelemetry\nGenAI conventions intend, and lowers the otel extra''s floors to 1.42 so it\ninstalls beside google-adk. No API change.\n\nRelocked so that only the kit pin moves; the repository''s own gate is green.","tree":{"sha":"851a7a9d9471bb4f5bd0f5a8e08455a0a82be5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/trees/851a7a9d9471bb4f5bd0f5a8e08455a0a82be5c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/commits/52184cc0bba5ff36e19713e928d658208aa52834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/52184cc0bba5ff36e19713e928d658208aa52834","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6UNoAKDUyMTg0Y2MwYmJhNWZmMzZlMTk3MTNlOTI4ZDY1ODIwOGFhNTI4MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/6e50eda39681ce86c422fab9094c14f2bf08a6e2","sha":"6e50eda39681ce86c422fab9094c14f2bf08a6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/6e50eda39681ce86c422fab9094c14f2bf08a6e2"}],"sha":"52184cc0bba5ff36e19713e928d658208aa52834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/52184cc0bba5ff36e19713e928d658208aa52834"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/6e50eda39681ce86c422fab9094c14f2bf08a6e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:22Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:22:01Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"35e5773831f3a273c7f4cbcf17874305f172d098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/trees/35e5773831f3a273c7f4cbcf17874305f172d098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/commits/6e50eda39681ce86c422fab9094c14f2bf08a6e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/othe