wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/e5c540f95980d4b69ce6a59b1597bdf3d3697491/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:45:44Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:48:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the memo draft through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nAdopt the fixed guardrail design from hex-service-template: a GuardrailPort\nwith local heuristic, regional Model Armor and on-prem placeholder adapters,\nthe SANCTIONS_GUARDRAIL three-state switch, and a boot refusal when the\nguardrail is on under gcp with no template named.\n\nThe Model Armor adapter allows only NO_MATCH_FOUND with invocation_result\nSUCCESS, read by enum name, with a per-call deadline; a match, a partial\nscreen, an empty result or an API error refuses.\n\nThe screening service screens the caller-supplied subject and then the whole\nprompt the drafter sends (domain/memo.py memo_prompt, which carries the party\nnames parsed from the payment message) before the drafter is called, and the\nreturned draft before the groundedness check. NarrationPort.draft_memo now\ntakes that screened prompt. The memo draft is optional, so a refusal is\naudited BLOCKED and the deterministic memo stands; the disposition is never\nblocked and no partial draft is kept.\n\nTerraform adds the regional template (gated on\nmodel_armor_full_capabilities, template_metadata shipped from the first\napply), roles/modelarmor.user, the API and perimeter entries, the\nGUARDRAIL env on Cloud Run and the google-beta provider with its lock and\ntftest mock. google-cloud-modelarmor joins the gcp extra and\nrequirements-gcp.lock. The demo''s exit tour calls the guardrail. Tests prove\nthe mapping against SDK-free IntEnum mirrors in every gate and against the\nreal modelarmor_v1 types where the SDK is installed. Docs that said no\nguardrail is wired now describe the bound one, and the rendered plugin is\nre-rendered from the already-synced skills.","tree":{"sha":"f768b87c5253c911090c44c395605e17b0c66aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/trees/f768b87c5253c911090c44c395605e17b0c66aa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/commits/e5c540f95980d4b69ce6a59b1597bdf3d3697491","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/