"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/24bf63a6262eb07457d28fbe850e5ae0a4f1ed7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:20:35Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:36:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Sync the canonical skills: model pills and the live profile","tree":{"sha":"381c80f6eea9cbce0aa5753833a3111da63a44e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/trees/381c80f6eea9cbce0aa5753833a3111da63a44e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/commits/24bf63a6262eb07457d28fbe850e5ae0a4f1ed7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/24bf63a6262eb07457d28fbe850e5ae0a4f1ed7f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6UNoAKDI0YmY2M2E2MjYyZWIwNzQ1N2QyOGZiZTg1MGU1YWUwYTRmMWVkN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae","sha":"cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae"}],"sha":"24bf63a6262eb07457d28fbe850e5ae0a4f1ed7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/24bf63a6262eb07457d28fbe850e5ae0a4f1ed7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:26:27Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:54:05Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23: every console shows two small pills at the top\nright, the model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool was\nused, in place of the full-width provenance banner that named what\nconfiguration would call. Ported from hex-service-template PR #36.\n\n- pyproject: hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7); the relock moved no other pin.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry whatever the model adapters note.\n- The local narration adapter (the generator port''s offline binding) notes\n  config.OFFLINE_STUB_MODEL, the same name generator_model reports under\n  local, so the configured and answered pills cannot disagree. The managed\n  narration (Gemini) and adverse-media (grounded search) adapters are\n  deployment-wired placeholders that raise, so they have no successful call\n  to note; no request type carries a temperature, so nothing is pinned.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver;\n  generator_model names what the adapter calls, never a flag-swapped model.\n- ui: ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx; one\n  window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested) reads both\n  headers; the proxy route now forwards them; the banner CSS is deleted.\n  The template''s dark-scheme pill override is left out: this page stays\n  light in either scheme, and the override showed the configured pill solid\n  and the answered one faint on it (measured in a browser).\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c: a model port notes its model and any search it\n  attached, and samples per call (temperature omitted, not 1.0, when free).\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (a screening answers with the stub name,\n  a faked search sets Search and does not leak into the next request,\n  /healthz sends neither, no flag moves generator_model), the pills contract\n  in test_ui_surface.py, test_provenance_banner_contract.py renamed to\n  test_model_pills_contract.py.","tree":{"sha":"8a0746da1ffa6841c0325ba5ddc056eca9cc9f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/trees/8a0746da1ffa6841c0325ba5ddc056eca9cc9f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/git/commits/cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6UNoAKGNkZjgwOGZlOGRmNGQzZmRhMTFmZGY5NzIwNDIwZjlkZTdiZWFkYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commit/47bf0b7c001c013a3cb87550ebec078e324af638","sha":"47bf0b7c001c013a3cb87550ebec078e324af638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/sanctions-screening/commits/47bf0b7c001c013a3cb87550ebec078e324af638"}],"sha":"cdf808fe8df4d3fda11fdf9720420f9de7beadae","url