GenAI conventions intend, and lowers the otel extra''s floors to 1.42 so it\ninstalls beside google-adk. No API change.\n\nRelocked so that only the kit pin moves; the repository''s own gate is green.","tree":{"sha":"83ccd506dda2f26f45378875676d03f281264f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/83ccd506dda2f26f45378875676d03f281264f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/d34d98019faca300d23f576b50e1d234bd2ccbaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/d34d98019faca300d23f576b50e1d234bd2ccbaa","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKGQzNGQ5ODAxOWZhY2EzMDBkMjNmNTc2YjUwZTFkMjM0YmQyY2NiYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/92f0678c305e1dbddaee9c72d758d93ce8146a24","sha":"92f0678c305e1dbddaee9c72d758d93ce8146a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/92f0678c305e1dbddaee9c72d758d93ce8146a24"}],"sha":"d34d98019faca300d23f576b50e1d234bd2ccbaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/d34d98019faca300d23f576b50e1d234bd2ccbaa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/92f0678c305e1dbddaee9c72d758d93ce8146a24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:20Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:14:18Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"3f3b857c81105f0185a6c0a3bc5a0aaf41914ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/3f3b857c81105f0185a6c0a3bc5a0aaf41914ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/92f0678c305e1dbddaee9c72d758d93ce8146a24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g