.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next to 16.3.8: critical RCE in next/og (GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j)\n\nnext 16.2.0 to 16.3.5 carries a critical remote code execution in\nnext/og ImageResponse, and the gate''s npm audit (--audit-level=high) now\nfails every pull request on it. The pin moves to 16.3.8, the first release\npast the advisory''s range on this line, and `npm audit fix` takes\nbaseline-browser-mapping past GHSA-w5vr-8v7q-w6rv (moderate). Lock-only\nchange; npm audit reports no vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"c83e79f1077b01e61e741562bc0e4e4af18a36c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/c83e79f1077b01e61e741562bc0e4e4af18a36c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/d736ea0e41f2190b8fd49c554b663300c73e41d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/d736ea0e41f2190b8fd49c554b663300c73e41d0","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKGQ3MzZlYTBlNDFmMjE5MGI4ZmQ0OWM1NTRiNjYzMzAwYzczZTQxZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0","sha":"d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0"}],"sha":"d736ea0e41f2190b8fd49c554b663300c73e41d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/d736ea0e41f2190b8fd49c554b663300c73e41d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:40:47Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:52:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 0\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"c8afde9541c011d0aa9897f488277a58115806a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/c8afde9541c011d0aa9897f488277a58115806a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKGQ1NDc5OWZjYmI1NzNhNGE4ZGUxNTc2NjBlZjg1ZTliNzc4ZmM5YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/16f131c0c59de1865777ff978058cd56cdfe2524","sha":"16f131c0c59de1865777ff978058cd56cdfe2524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/16f131c0c59de1865777ff978058cd56cdfe2524"}],"sha":"d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/d54799fcbb573a4a8de157660ef85e9b778fc9c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/16f131c0c59de1865777ff978058cd56cdfe2524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:34:24Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:37:26Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the customer-warning draft through a guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nAdopt the fixed guardrail design from hex-service-template: a GuardrailPort with\na local heuristic, a regional Model Armor adapter that allows only on\nNO_MATCH_FOUND from a SUCCESS screen (read by enum name, with a deadline), and an\non-prem placeholder that refuses; the SCAMINTERDICT_GUARDRAIL switch; the Model\nArmor template gated on model_armor_full_capabilities with template_metadata;\nroles/modelarmor.user; google-beta with its lock entry and tftest mock; and\ngoogle-cloud-modelarmor in the gcp extra and runtime lock.\n\nThe warning request is screened INPUT, every field as the generator receives it,\nbefore a draft is requested, and the draft OUTPUT before it is validated or used,\nexactly as the screen hands it back. The warning is optional by design, so a\nrefusal, a rewritten structured request, or a guardrail that cannot decide is\naudited as its own guardrail_blocked record and the deterministic warning ships;\nthe verdict never changes. monitoring.tf alerts on those records, the portability\ntour calls the guardrail seam, and the docs stop saying the gateway is unbound.","tree":{"sha":"7886c3ff2f3d707d72a161b879e191713bf034ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/7886c3ff2f3d707d72a161b879e191713bf034ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdictio