om/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/713b1d527aa6d8d21761fa8ace94ab14c22c851f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:26:02Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:28:46Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23 (cleanup slice 5): the console shows two small pills\nat the top right, the model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool\nwas used, in place of the full-width provenance banner. Ported from\nhex-service-template PR #36.\n\n- hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7); the relock moved no other pin.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app), so X-Answered-By and\n  X-Search-Used carry what the model adapters note.\n- The local warning generator notes its stub name (deterministic-offline-stub,\n  what generator_model reports under local). The managed generator is a\n  placeholder that raises, so it answers nothing and notes nothing; a draft\n  that fails ships the deterministic fallback and sends no header.\n- Sampling: WarningRequest carries no temperature, and drafting a customer\n  warning is narration, so nothing is pinned; a test holds that.\n- config.py: the hard-reasoning branch is deleted from the model resolver.\n- ui/app/ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx, reading\n  /healthz then both headers through one window.fetch wrapper\n  (lib/answer-provenance.mjs, node-tested); the proxy forwards both headers.\n  The banner and its CSS are deleted. The pills keep the page''s single light\n  scheme: the template''s dark-mode pill rule would invert them against this\n  always-light page.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (stub named on a real interdiction, a failed\n  draft names nothing, a search is reported and does not leak, no temperature,\n  no flag moves generator_model), the pills contract in test_ui_surface.py, the\n  banner contract renamed to test_model_pill_contract.py.\n- CONTRIBUTING row 5c.\n\nVisually checked on a local run: pills at (859,6)-(1014,28) in a 1024px\nviewport, clear of the h1 at y=32 and every control; configured -> answered\nafter \"Assess this payment\".","tree":{"sha":"20cd6d203f519717f0515ebe1d72dc01bc8ad459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/20cd6d203f519717f0515ebe1d72dc01bc8ad459"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/713b1d527aa6d8d21761fa8ace94ab14c22c851f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u