nged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"ac5ec12fb21d2b3aa34f200a2c28d50a0ef5a63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/ac5ec12fb21d2b3aa34f200a2c28d50a0ef5a63d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/36ee24931285aeceed457fd7df40242b432cc730","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/36ee24931285aeceed457fd7df40242b432cc730","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKDM2ZWUyNDkzMTI4NWFlY2VlZDQ1N2ZkN2RmNDAyNDJiNDMyY2M3MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74","sha":"463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74"}],"sha":"36ee24931285aeceed457fd7df40242b432cc730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/36ee24931285aeceed457fd7df40242b432cc730"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:08:10Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false twice over: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on\nand no console is named, and SCAMINTERDICT_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing\noff, so human_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"72eeaf3ece34dc68f6db18d4734721515a324bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/72eeaf3ece34dc68f6db18d4734721515a324bd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKDQ2M2UwMTI3NDQ5MWFjYmVjMDEzNDEyOGY2YjU3NTMyMjg5YjFhNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036","sha":"90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036"}],"sha":"463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/463e01274491acbec0134128f6b57532289b1a74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:09:42Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:11:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch review routing, refuse at boot without a console, report hand-offs\n\nTemplate-shape application of the fleet''s runtime-control contract. Review routing is the\none cheap runtime control this service has, so it is the one switch.\n\n- SCAMINTERDICT_REVIEW_ROUTING is read once at settings load in three states: unset is on, a\n  boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off binds a disabled router and\n  logs one warning per process, however many containers are built.\n- Under gcp, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot. It used to surface as a\n  failed request on the first escalation, after the assessment had been computed and audited.\n- POST /v1/interdict, the assess_payment agent tool and both CLI commands (interdict, stream) hand off through a recording wrapper, so a hand-off that fails no longer\n  fails the assessment: the result carries review_routing (routed, failed, off, not_required)\n  and an empty review_ref, and the failure is logged. The console states the outcome in\n  plain words.\n- Terraform gains review_routing_enabled, sets the service''s switch from it, and relaxes the\n  edge''s console requirement only when routing is stated off; a new plan test holds that.\n- SPEC, COMPLIANCE, the practices audit, the compliance, security and features FAQs, .env.example and the runbook no longer say the managed router refuses at request time; they describe the boot refusal, the switch and the reported outcome.\n- pii-kit masking here protects the audit trail, tool results and the review payload rather\n  than a user''s free-text question, so it is not the redaction control the contract\n  switches, and it gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"89c19a7748a21f5d7e1b37955f850ce64060e828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/89c19a7748a21f5d7e1b37955f850ce64060e828"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKDkwZDUyMzY0MzU2OGY3OWUzNmQ3Mzk5YzEwNDBhNTFjY2UzMTMwMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3","sha":"fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3"}],"sha":"90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/90d523643568f79e36d7399c1040a51cce313036"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:49:35Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:54:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"d8f331102f224a4ea183b3eb4b2b064a8b4ef209","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/trees/d8f331102f224a4ea183b3eb4b2b064a8b4ef209"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/git/commits/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh6tNoAKGZlNzQ1MDg3ZTZjYzA0N2MzYzg5NTlmZDI1OWZiMGQ1NjQ2NjcyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commit/17a0113cb7b190003eb5f5c62d9c645ce5f010cc","sha":"17a0113cb7b190003eb5f5c62d9c645ce5f010cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/17a0113cb7b190003eb5f5c62d9c645ce5f010cc"}],"sha":"fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/fe745087e6cc047c3c8959fd259fb0d5646672c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/app-fraud-interdiction/commits/17a0113cb7b190003eb5f5c62d9c645ce5f010cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T11:15:11Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:15:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump the npm-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 6 updates\n\nBumps the npm-minor-patch group with 6 updates in the /ui directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) | `16.3.4` | `16.3.5` |\n| [react](https://github.com/react/react/tree/HEAD/packages/react) | `19.2.8` | `19.3.0` |\n| [@types/react](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/react) | `19.2.18` | `19.3.0` |\n| [react-dom](https://github.com/react/react/tree/HEAD/packages/react-dom) | `19.2.8` | `19.3.0` |\n| [@types/react-dom](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/react-dom) | `19.2.5` | `19.3.0` |\n| [@types/node](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/tree/HEAD/types/node) | `26.4.0` | `26.5.1` |\n\n\n\nUpdates `next` from 16.3.4 to 16.3.5\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.4...v16.3.5)\n\nUpdates `react` from 19.2.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/react/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/react/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/react/react/commits/v19.3.0/packages/react)\n\nUpdates `@types/react` from 19.2.18 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react)\n\nUpdates `react-dom` from 19.2.8 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/react/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/react/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/react/react/commits/v19.3.0/packages/react-dom)\n\nUpdates `@types/react-dom` from 19.2.5 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react-dom)\n\nUpdates `@types/node` from 26.4.0 to 26.5.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/node)\n\nUpdates `@types/react` from 19.2.18 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react)\n\nUpdates `@types/react-dom` from 19.2.5 to 19.3.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped/commits/HEAD/types/react-dom)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.5\n  dependency-type: direct