i@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:53:46Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next to 16.3.8: critical RCE in next/og (GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j)\n\nnext 16.2.0 to 16.3.5 carries a critical remote code execution in\nnext/og ImageResponse, and the gate''s npm audit (--audit-level=high) now\nfails every pull request on it. The pin moves to 16.3.8, the first release\npast the advisory''s range on this line, and `npm audit fix` takes\nbaseline-browser-mapping past GHSA-w5vr-8v7q-w6rv (moderate). Lock-only\nchange; npm audit reports no vulnerabilities.","tree":{"sha":"b6734864b6839dea5ebac15bdaeea804ff61b221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/b6734864b6839dea5ebac15bdaeea804ff61b221"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/0e20d63f2d84d59c3dd2e68968f13a07e7244f52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith