{"date":"2026-09-27T23:32:09Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Model Armor: allow only on a complete, clean screen\n\nThe safety adapter allowed anything whose filterMatchState was not MATCH_FOUND, so a missing\nresult, an unspecified state, and a PARTIAL or FAILURE screen all passed; a skipped filter\nreports NO_MATCH_FOUND, so a prompt padded past the prompt-injection filter''s token limit got\nthrough unscreened. It also labelled categories with the substring test \"MATCH_FOUND\" in\nstr(node), which NO_MATCH_FOUND satisfies.\n\nText is now allowed only when filterMatchState is exactly NO_MATCH_FOUND and invocationResult\nis exactly SUCCESS; everything else blocks, HTTP errors propagate, and every call has a 30 s\ndeadline. Categories come from a recursive walk for an exact matchState of MATCH_FOUND.\n\ntests/unit/test_model_armor_verdict_mapping.py covers the mapping SDK-free (runs in CI) and\nagainst real modelarmor_v1 messages where the SDK is installed; the SDK-free half fails against\nthe old mapping.","tree":{"sha":"caab91aca4818ed2d7e7021284a0b0e614f8d4ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/caab91aca4818ed2d7e7021284a0b0e614f8d4ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/0600cd0134379ff65a3f5623d9dfae7cc6eeb4ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://