lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/441f9420d4c7306687f58dbdd2948e2109f1d343/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:30:27Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:33:18Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Add the laptop live profile: narration from the local model via the kit client\n\nThe live profile binds every port to its local adapter except generation, which\ncalls the shared local open-weight model through hex_service_kit.localmodel\n(v0.0.9). It takes the local laptop posture through config.posture_of: loopback\nbound, seeded personas, dev CORS, docs, zero-secret S2S opening.\n\nThe narration request carries no schema, so the adapter asks for a JSON draft\n(narrative, runbook) and the kit validates and retries it; cited ids stay derived\nfrom the request. An unreachable model answers 503 with the start recipe, an\nunusable one 502, both before the audit write. The banner names the local model\nid when the generation binding is the live adapter.","tree":{"sha":"06842dc0aba0fcb82374c9fc2c40a8bc57c3599b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/06842dc0aba0fcb82374c9fc2c40a8bc57c3599b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/441f9420d4c7306687f58dbdd2948e2109f1d343","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/441f9420d4c7306687f58dbdd2948e2109f1d343","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDQ0MWY5NDIwZDRjNzMwNjY4N2Y1OGRiZGQyOTQ4ZTIxMDlmMWQzNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/b63f90bf221d50527813c50444fc934fb75b3c69","sha":"b63f90bf221d50527813c50444fc934fb75b3c69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/b63f90bf221d50527813c50444fc934fb75b3c69"}],"sha":"441f9420d4c7306687f58dbdd2948e2109f1d343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/441f9420d4c7306687f58dbdd2948e2109f1d343"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/b63f90bf221d50527813c50444fc934fb75b3c69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:50:59Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T04:00:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin review-kit v0.0.2, the release the rest of the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"4dc7cfd4a756ddf179638e193c8fd6701595a6c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/4dc7cfd4a756ddf1