ps://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/8e6ad491b0839f1ff9930c3654c9083a9a7a2501/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:11:16Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the review-routing comments to the boot refusal\n\nThe variables.tf header and the review_url comment in settings.yaml still\nsaid the managed review router refuses to swallow an escalation when\nHUMAN_REVIEW_URL is empty. Since the runtime control switches landed that\nis false twice over: the service refuses at BOOT when review routing is on\nand no console is named, and FRAUDFUSION_REVIEW_ROUTING=false switches routing\noff, so human_review_url is only required with review_routing_enabled on.\n\nComment-only; no behaviour changes.","tree":{"sha":"85a7d17e729a5f30d4710924766368777e791db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/85a7d17e729a5f30d4710924766368777e791db1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/8e6ad491b0839f1ff9930c3654c9083a9a7a2501","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/8e6ad491b0839f1ff9930c3654c9083a9a7a2501","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDhlNmFkNDkxYjA4MzlmMWZmOTkzMGMzNjU0YzkwODNhOWE3YTI1MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f","sha":"05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f"}],"sha":"8e6ad491b0839f1ff9930c3654c9083a9a7a2501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/8e6ad491b0839f1ff9930c3654c9083a9a7a2501"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:27:43Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:30:23Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch the guardrail and review routing, and refuse at boot when either cannot work\n\nApplies the fleet''s runtime-control contract (template shape). This service has two cheap\nruntime controls: the guardrail on the safety port and review routing.\n\n- FRAUDFUSION_GUARDRAIL and FRAUDFUSION_REVIEW_ROUTING are read once at settings load in three\n  states. Off binds an allow-all guardrail (reason \"guardrail off\") or a router that submits\n  nothing, and one warning per process names what is off. The port key stays \"safety\".\n- Under gcp, the guardrail on with an empty FRAUDFUSION_MODEL_ARMOR_TEMPLATE (its default) or\n  an empty FRAUDFUSION_PROJECT_ID refuses at boot. The Model Armor adapter built\n  .../projects/<project>/locations/<region>/templates/<template>:sanitize... from whatever it\n  had, so either gap was a malformed URL at the first screen. Routing on with no\n  HUMAN_REVIEW_URL also refuses at boot instead of failing the first escalation.\n- The API, the triage_incident agent tool and the CLI hand off through a recording wrapper, so\n  a failed hand-off no longer fails the incident: the result carries review_routing (routed,\n  failed, off, not_required) and the failure is logged. The console states it in plain words.\n- Terraform gains guardrail_enabled, model_armor_template and review_routing_enabled; the\n  service is told both switches, its project and (when named) its template; the edge requires\n  a template while the guardrail is on and a console while routing is on; the serving identity\n  gets roles/modelarmor.user only while the guardrail is on, and the Model Armor API is\n  enabled. The Terraform never set the project or template the adapter reads, so the managed\n  guardrail could not have worked from this stack before. Plan tests hold all of it.\n- SPEC and the security FAQ now describe the switches and boot refusals; the runbook gains\n  both; COMPLIANCE and the practices audit no longer say the router refuses at request time.\n- pii-kit masking here minimises the audit trail, tool results and the review payload, so it\n  gains no switch.","tree":{"sha":"89ddf02c385d0aad5d9b1e3904ec2a13029286e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/89ddf02c385d0aad5d9b1e3904ec2a13029286e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDA1ZTI5ZTc2YjQ1MzY1MzZjN2Q2OTg0ZGRiYTRkOGRkNTc3NjBhM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140","sha":"2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140"}],"sha":"05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/05e29e76b4536536c7d6984ddba4d8dd57760a3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:51:04Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:08:39Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the default off the audit bucket lock\n\nworm_locked defaulted to true, so the first apply of this stack in any\nproject locked its audit bucket irreversibly for the whole retention window,\nwith nothing in that deployment''s own tfvars saying so. The fleet decided on\n2026-09-12 that an irreversible control takes no default; this stack was one\nof 33 that sweep never reached.\n\nA plan now refuses until the deployment states the lock. The Terraform tests\nstate it once per file in the production form, still assert that a stated\nlock sits on the six-month floor, and gain a run proving the unlocked posture\ncreates an unlocked bucket. That run fails if the lock is ever hard-coded\nback into the bucket, which every other run would miss.","tree":{"sha":"2976e001f68314c92cb378001662088761afdf70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/2976e001f68314c92cb378001662088761afdf70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDJmN2EyNDkyMDVlZDQ2NjhlZTgzYWRiYWU4NzhkMTJhYjNkNDUxNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58","sha":"eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58"}],"sha":"2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/2f7a249205ed4668ee83adbae878d12ab3d45140"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T17:46:20Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:32:00Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump ruff in the python-minor-patch group across 1 directory\n\nBumps the python-minor-patch group with 1 update in the / directory: [ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff).\n\n\nUpdates `ruff` from 0.16.5 to 0.16.7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/compare/0.16.5...0.16.7)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: ruff\n  dependency-version: 0.16.6\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: python-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f533f6b3d489a48417e137e0e060ca6a46e0dbfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/f533f6b3d489a48417e137e0e060ca6a46e0dbfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKGVhYTUwZDZlZDIwZDliODUxMGJlNWRkMmUwMzgyNDQ0MmU0MDFhNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2","sha":"a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2"}],"sha":"eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/eaa50d6ed20d9b8510be5dd2e03824442e401a58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:44:53Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:13:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Make customer-managed encryption optional, and off by default\n\nEvery binding to the stack''s Cloud KMS key now sits behind cmek_enabled,\ndefault false: the key ring, the key, every grant to a service agent, and\nevery store, log bucket, registry and revision that took the key. Block\nbindings became dynamic blocks; scalar bindings read the key through one(),\nwhich is null when the key does not exist and omits the attribute rather\nthan pointing it at nothing. The Terraform tests that assert on key material\nturn the gate on to keep meaning what they meant.\n\nWhy the default is off: a key ring can never be deleted, a log bucket that\nhas CMEK can never drop it, and registries and document stores take their\nkey at creation. None of that changes an answer or a screen, and everything\nis encrypted at rest with Google-managed keys regardless. A deployment with\na customer whose data it must shred, whose key access must be audited or\nwhose keys must live in an HSM sets it true in its own tfvars BEFORE the\nfirst apply. Where a stack already applied it, the key''s prevent_destroy\nrefuses a plan that omits the line, which is the right answer: the stores it\nbound stay bound.\n\nThe vendored deploy-and-residency-hardening skill says the same.","tree":{"sha":"6a7fecce00dd53a82f022f913b1622f6634b4568","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/6a7fecce00dd53a82f022f913b1622f6634b4568"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKGExYTVkNjI0MzNmNzVmZGM3YWY1YThkMWQ3N2FiYzliMWU4NGJlZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51","sha":"d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51"}],"sha":"a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/a1a5d62433f75fdc7af5a8d1d77abc9b1e84bed2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:18:31Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:31:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Resync the embeddable-UI skill: both assertion header names\n\nThe canonical skill told the next repository to verify \"the injected\n`x-goog-iap-jwt-assertion`\" and nothing else, which is the instruction that\nproduced the defect this branch fixes. Fixed at the source in org-metadata and\nvendored here.\n\nOnly this one skill is resynced rather than the whole set, because\ndeploy-and-residency-hardening is in flight on another branch and a blanket\n`sync-skills.sh` would pull that unmerged work in with it.","tree":{"sha":"b44c0760123dd07f0c0abe4427281a46a80f46c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/b44c0760123dd07f0c0abe4427281a46a80f46c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKGQ3MjhhYWUwYjczOGZhNDE1ZGFlZTVhMTVkZDI2YzZkNzNjMGVmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288","sha":"0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288"}],"sha":"d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/d728aae0b738fa415daee5a15dd26c6d73c0ef51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:04:18Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:31:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Read the IAP assertion under both names a request can carry it\n\n`x-goog-*` is Google''s reserved namespace and the serverless frontend strips\nthat whole namespace from a request entering a service, so an embedding host\nbehind IAP cannot forward the assertion its own edge was handed under the\nstandard name. It sends the same value as `x-portal-iap-assertion` as well,\nand this adapter read only the reserved one.\n\nSo this service would have answered 401 to EVERY authenticated caller the day\nit was embedded, and said \"request did not pass through IAP\" about a request\nthat passed through IAP one hop earlier. Nothing would have reported it: the\ngate is green, a console''s first calls need no identity at all, and the unit\nsuite builds its own request, so it could only ever choose the header the\nauthor had in mind.\n\nThe read is now the commons selection function, which examines both names,\nprefers the edge-injected one for diagnosis rather than for trust, strips so a\nheader a proxy rendered blank is absent rather than malformed, and names both\nheaders in its refusal so an operator reads which hop dropped one.\n\ntests/unit/test_embedded_assertion_transport.py is the standing proof, and it\nwas falsified first: with only the header read reverted, five of its cases\nfail, including the one that resolves the contradiction between a passing\nclaim suite and a live 401.","tree":{"sha":"127e9d2071ee4ffd92550ef4740897505ed95006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/127e9d2071ee4ffd92550ef4740897505ed95006"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDBiODg3NmU3OGRlMjc3NmZhMzg4ZTYzMWZiNjU0YmI5MTUyZTUyODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca","sha":"5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca"}],"sha":"0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/0b8876e78de2776fa388e631fb654bb9152e5288"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:41:06Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:54:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the posture alerts, and stop copying every audit log into this bucket\n\nTwo changes the deployed stacks already carry, brought to the rest of the\nfleet so a fork does not inherit either on its first apply.\n\nThe posture alert policies and the log-based metrics behind them now sit\nbehind posture_alerts_enabled, default false. Cloud Monitoring bills every\nmetric-based alert condition, and a deployment with nobody on call buys\nnothing with them; the signals still land in Cloud Logging, where an operator\ncan read them.\n\nThe audit sink routes only this application''s own ledger into its bucket. It\nused to copy every Cloud Audit Log entry as well, which is a second\nCMEK-encrypted ingestion of what _Default already keeps for thirty days.\n\nNothing here is applied anywhere, so neither change moves a live resource.\nWhat they remove is the trap a fork inherits the day it applies.","tree":{"sha":"62eeb036f3c31bae233ba01285fdbfd708958dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/62eeb036f3c31bae233ba01285fdbfd708958dba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDVhZTM0ZTdkZjAzNGI4ODY5NDkyODVjZWEyYzZkZmQ1YThmZmYwY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7","sha":"4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7"}],"sha":"5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/5ae34e7df034b886949285cea2c6dfd5a8fff0ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:07:14Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:17:00Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Vendor the reduced required-artifact set\n\nThe portfolio gate stopped requiring `docs/practices-audit.md`,\n`docs/onprem-migration.md` and a fleet-wide `COMPLIANCE.md` on 2026-09-13, and the\ncanonical skills README was updated to match. This is the vendored copy following, so\nthe convention this repository carries is the one actually in force.\n\nThe scorecard shipped PRE-FILLED from a template render, so requiring it fleet-wide\nmeant every repository asserting a per-check verdict nobody had reached. The exit guide\ndocumented a migration for a profile that is a deliberate fail-fast placeholder. The\nprinciple-to-control mapping is now a launch-set expectation, because it is what a\nbuyer is shown.\n\nRetiring a requirement does not delete a file this repository already has. Nothing is\nremoved here; only the statement of what is required changes.\n\nVendored by `sync-skills.sh` from the canonical copy in org-metadata, never edited in\nplace, so the drift check stays green.","tree":{"sha":"e8313887c17178788a0009f044e3708f881125b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/e8313887c17178788a0009f044e3708f881125b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDRiN2M2N2ExNTNkNzYwODAxYWMyODJiNDJjN2E0NTJjZDI5YjU0Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b","sha":"84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b"}],"sha":"4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/4b7c67a153d760801ac282b42c7a452cd29b54f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:29:31Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:56:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the project audit config, and default it off\n\n`google_project_iam_audit_config` is AUTHORITATIVE for the service it names, so a\nstack declaring `allServices` does not add to the project''s audit configuration,\nit REPLACES it. Forty-eight stacks in this fleet declared it unconditionally and\nfour gated it, which is the collision the posture record already documents as the\nreason those four decline: a stack asking for DATA_READ and DATA_WRITE removes an\nADMIN_READ a sibling enabled, and Terraform reports it as a create rather than a\nchange, because the stack holds no prior state for a resource that is already live.\n\nThis stack now carries `manage_audit_config`, defaulted false. A deployment that\nwants data-access logging names it in its own tfvars, in exactly one stack per\nproject. Data-access logs are also the highest-volume class Cloud Logging ingests,\nand nothing in the reference deployment reads them.\n\nVerified: terraform fmt is clean and terraform validate passes on every touched\ntree; the three Terraform test suites asserting plan-level refusals pass.","tree":{"sha":"8b46bd21abcc10c35a28836a0579d6875085b321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/8b46bd21abcc10c35a28836a0579d6875085b321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDg0ZTBjNDY3M2VkYjcxODk2NmNmNzk1Y2Y1NjE4ZTMyMjY5OGRlMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761","sha":"ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761"}],"sha":"84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/84e0c4673edb718966cf795cf5618e322698de1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T11:47:13Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T11:49:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Fix stale P-03 and P-09 claims in COMPLIANCE.md\n\nP-03: repository-policy.json already sets terraform_test: true for\ninfra/terraform, and the offline-gate workflow runs\nproduction_edge.tftest.hcl on every push and pull request, so the\n\"no terraform CI job\" claim was stale. Add a tf-check make target\nso the same four commands are runnable locally.\n\nP-09: kms.tf, iam.tf, bigquery.tf and logging_worm.tf already provide\nregional CMEK, a least-privilege serving identity and CMEK-encrypted\nBigQuery and logging storage, so the row is rewritten to describe what\nis actually in place. Private endpoints and a distinct agent identity\nare still genuinely absent, so those TODOs stay.","tree":{"sha":"e120e8eb4cdd8deb632c316fdbb96036a50f8d71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/e120e8eb4cdd8deb632c316fdbb96036a50f8d71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKGRkZmJjNmEwMjRmYzJhNjAyNTRmZmE3MDI4Zjg0NjAxY2JiYjU3NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26","sha":"9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26"}],"sha":"ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/ddfbc6a024fc2a60254ffa7028f84601cbbb5761"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:34:51Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:38:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Declare the key the dataset stamps on every table, so a plan stops replacing them\n\nThe dataset declares a default_encryption_configuration, so BigQuery stamps that key\nonto every table it creates in it. None of this stack''s 2 table resources\ndeclared an encryption_configuration, so Terraform reads the live server-set block as\na REMOVAL, and removing an encryption configuration is a REPLACING change: the table\nis destroyed and recreated, and a recreated table holds no rows. The dataset is\napplied and loaded in the deployment project, so it was armed.\n\nProved by execution in cio-advisory on 2026-09-12, not reasoned about here: a plan\nbefore that stack''s first full apply reported every table as must be replaced, with\nencryption_configuration { # forces replacement } as the cause, over 63 loaded rows.\nIndependent of the loader defect fixed today: that one rewrote the declared schema,\nthis one removes the key.\n\nGuarded offline, each watched failing first against a copy with one declaration\ndeleted, and green again on restore: the contract test asserts every table declares\nan encryption_configuration naming the dataset''s key AND that the count of\ndeclarations equals the count of table resources, so a table added later without one\nfails; bigquery_cmek.tftest.hcl asserts the same at plan level under a mocked\nprovider.","tree":{"sha":"13fe6abb50b53c4f370126da8db644a59e525cf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/13fe6abb50b53c4f370126da8db644a59e525cf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh7E9oAKDliMDVkZTNjMTAzOWRkZjQ1NmY2OWM4MWU3Y2Q0YTY1OTIyNzFkMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/602d338326eb410400fc7ddba382a5f538d72974","sha":"602d338326eb410400fc7ddba382a5f538d72974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/602d338326eb410400fc7ddba382a5f538d72974"}],"sha":"9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/9b05de3c1039ddf456f69c81e7cd4a6592271d26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commits/602d338326eb410400fc7ddba382a5f538d72974/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:16:45Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:19:04Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Load into the schema the table already has, instead of replacing it\n\nA BigQuery load with WRITE_TRUNCATE and no schema autodetects one from the rows\nand replaces the table''s own. Nothing fails when that happens: this book loaded,\nthe demos read it, and every gate stayed green.\n\nWhat it costs arrives at the next plan. The same loader shape was fixed in\ncio-advisory after planning that stack before its first full apply reported all\nfive tables of its demo book as must-be-replaced: the live schema carried its\ncolumns in the order the JSON serialised them with every mode relaxed to\nNULLABLE, while infra/terraform declares them REQUIRED in its own order, and\nBigQuery cannot narrow a mode in place. Terraform''s only move is to destroy and\nrecreate, and a recreated table holds no rows. This repository''s dataset is\napplied and loaded by the same shared pattern, so it was armed the same way.\n\nPassing the table''s own schema makes a row that does not fit the declared\ncolumns fail its load, which is the failure that belongs to a data defect. The\nshipped rows were checked against bigquery.tf column by column before this\nlanded, nested RECORDs and REQUIRED modes included, so the stricter load has\nnothing to reject.\n\ntests/unit/test_demo_book_loader_keeps_the_declared_schema.py drives the loader\nagainst a fake BigQuery client, because the offline venv holds no cloud SDK, and\nasserts every load job carries the schema of the table it writes to. Deleting\nthe argument on a copy of the loader turns it red.","tree":{"sha":"1649486a2f4156c04c68c7afb4942c6757ca39cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/trees/1649486a2f4156c04c68c7afb4942c6757ca39cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/git/commits/602d338326eb410400fc7ddba382a5f538d72974","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/soc-fraud-fusion/commit/602d3383