tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/991dbdcdaa35b3d106036de4b7736c8f5cbd0d31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:01:12Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:06:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nOwner decision 2026-09-23 (cleanup slice 5): the console shows small pills at\nthe top right, the model that ANSWERED and Search when an online search tool\nwas used, in place of the full-width provenance banner.\n\n- pyproject: hex-service-kit v0.0.10 (0e71fc7). The relock moved no other pin.\n- api/app.py installs install_answer_provenance(app). This console binds no\n  model port (routing, clocks and quorum are deterministic; the decision is a\n  human''s), so nothing is noted, no response carries either header, and the\n  pill shows the configured no-model from /healthz. The kit also lists both\n  headers in Access-Control-Expose-Headers, which this console needs because\n  it calls the service cross-origin.\n- ui/components/ModelPills.tsx replaces ProvenanceBanner.tsx in layout.tsx,\n  reading /healthz and watching responses through the same lib/api base as\n  every other call (there is no same-origin proxy here, so no route to\n  forward headers). One window.fetch wrapper (lib/answer-provenance.mjs,\n  node-tested in scripts/answer-provenance.test.mjs) reads both headers.\n  Tailwind default gray/emerald: the banner''s ink-* classes were never\n  defined in this console''s theme, so they styled nothing. No dark-scheme\n  variant: the console is light-only.\n- tests: test_answer_provenance.py (no header from the human-review routes; a\n  noting service on the real route yields both headers and exposes them; the\n  pill starts from no-model; no use_hard_reasoning flag exists), the banner\n  contract test rewritten as test_model_pill_contract.py.\n- CONTRIBUTING: a new model port notes what answered and samples per call.\n\nNo use_hard_reasoning and no temperature existed here, so no call sites.","tree":{"sha":"5cb182b324ba920128ad055d33da88ed3dd04041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/5cb182b324ba920128ad055d33da88ed3dd04041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/991dbdcdaa35b3d106036de4b7736c8f5cbd0d31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt