","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/16646fbfba0b39735bf5be33108310af5d93d03b","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDE2NjQ2ZmJmYmEwYjM5NzM1YmY1YmUzMzEwODMxMGFmNWQ5M2QwM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/5f12b2fd3a02d2096e971278eb6deda2ba332ca8","sha":"5f12b2fd3a02d2096e971278eb6deda2ba332ca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/5f12b2fd3a02d2096e971278eb6deda2ba332ca8"}],"sha":"16646fbfba0b39735bf5be33108310af5d93d03b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/16646fbfba0b39735bf5be33108310af5d93d03b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/5f12b2fd3a02d2096e971278eb6deda2ba332ca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:13:31Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:19:15Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Authenticate service hand-offs from the forwarded IAP assertion\n\nDeployed producers now reach the service intake through the portal''s IAP\nedge. The portal replaces Authorization with its own service token on\nevery request it forwards, a reviewer''s browser requests included, so\nbehind the edge a bearer names the portal and nobody else. Accepting it\nas a service caller would let any signed-in reviewer POST a forged maker\nand tenant into the maker-checker queue.\n\nUnder gcp and platform (the profiles whose identity binding is the IAP\nadapter) POST /v1/service/reviews and /v1/audit/ping no longer read\nAuthorization. They verify the forwarded IAP assertion on the reviewer\npath''s own checks (REVIEW_IAP_AUDIENCE, algorithm pin, signature, issuer,\nrequired claims) and admit only the service accounts listed in\nREVIEW_IAP_SERVICE_CALLERS_JSON: 401 for no or an unverifiable\nassertion, 403 for a verified caller the list does not name (every\nhuman), 503 when no audience is configured. The list is read at boot in\nthree states: unset admits no machine caller, emptied or malformed\n(including a person''s address or a wildcard) refuses to start.\n\nlocal and onprem keep the shared-secret REVIEW_S2S_TOKEN path unchanged.\nTerraform gains iap_service_callers (default empty, env left unset), and\nthe runbook, SPEC, .env.example and config table document the variable.","tree":{"sha":"a7bc2065444a8825ffbf6d6a3137cf3744507cd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/a7bc2065444a8825ffbf6d6a3137cf3744507cd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/5f12b2fd3a02d2096e971278eb6deda2ba332ca8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.