l":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/5f5ab21aed194b182ce6bc72a757c247bb76b096"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/69570a760f920514b33245ad6d8cd3d404a638ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/69570a760f920514b33245ad6d8cd3d404a638ef","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDY5NTcwYTc2MGY5MjA1MTRiMzMyNDVhZDZkOGNkM2Q0MDRhNjM4ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e","sha":"0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e"}],"sha":"69570a760f920514b33245ad6d8cd3d404a638ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/69570a760f920514b33245ad6d8cd3d404a638ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:16Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:38:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"966f83886b7cd0b602e8d18bc97f7d8551c30f40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/966f83886b7cd0b602e8d18bc97f7d8551c30f40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDA4NjJkMzU4OTRhMDQ3NjYzOTFmNWY2ZmViM2Y4ZjFiYWY5ZmVmMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d","sha":"fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d"}],"sha":"0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/0862d35894a04766391f5f6feb3f8f1baf9fef2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:54:57Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:22:48Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4 in /ui\n\nBumps [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.4)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"160ae181ef453e0762004d0381f16c84a35eaf75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/160ae181ef453e0762004d0381f16c84a35eaf75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKGZjN2Y1OTdiYWY0MzRlMzE5YjU1NGEyZGZjYzU1NmFjMjkwNDgwMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd","sha":"bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd"}],"sha":"fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/fc7f597baf434e319b554a2dfcc556ac2904802d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:49:21Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T03:57:42Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin the browser half of the provenance contract\n\nThis console''s provenance strip works. It names where the runtime sits and\nwhich model answers at the top of every page, reading both off `/healthz`\nthrough the same base the rest of the console reads. Nothing here changes that.\nWhat was missing is the check that says so.\n\nThe service half is already pinned, in tests/unit/test_health_provenance.py: the\nprofile implies a runtime, the schema carries both fields, the endpoint answers\nfrom the binding the container builds rather than from a literal. All of that\nwas also true and green on 2026-09-04 in eight consoles that had been rendering\nNOTHING on every page load since the banner landed. The strip there named\n`/api/agent`, the same-origin route handler the service template ships, in\ntrees that ship no such handler; the health call reached a path nothing serves\nand took the failure branch, which renders nothing on purpose, because a strip\nthat guessed would assert provenance it does not have. A check that cannot fail\nloudly fails as an ABSENCE, and an absent strip is what no reviewer notices. A\ngreen service half says nothing about whether a reader ever sees the sentence.\n\nSo the browser half gets its own file, asserting the three things the service\nhalf cannot: the strip is mounted in the LAYOUT rather than in a page, it names\nthe proxy exactly when this tree ships one, and whatever it pulls itself up by,\nthe host must carry that much padding to give back.\n\nThe assertions pin AGREEMENT rather than literals, because this fleet runs the\nconsole in more than one shape and a check keyed on one shape passes by\nblindness in the others. This tree keeps the strip in ui/components/ProvenanceBanner.tsx, styled with utility classes;\nthe trees that took the 2026-08-31 sweep keep it in `ui/app/` under\n`.provenance-banner`. A survey keyed on the sweep''s path and class reported\nnine working consoles as having no banner at all, which is the mistake this\nfile is written not to make: it locates the component by the sentence it\nrenders, not by where the sentence sits.\n\nFalsified before it was trusted. Pointing the strip at `/api/agent` fails the\nfetch assertion; adding a negative top-margin utility, or removing the body\npadding a `.provenance-banner` margin cancels, fails the geometry one;\nunmounting it from the layout fails the third. Reverting each clears it.","tree":{"sha":"58c2b9e92e35b257e89de50da6205fbfd6b48ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/58c2b9e92e35b257e89de50da6205fbfd6b48ac8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKGJjOTM2MDFlZDgwNDc2ZjU3ZTVlOTkzNzg0YjNhNTllODdlMjI3ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465","sha":"644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465"}],"sha":"bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/bc93601ed80476f57e5e993784b3a59e87e227fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:51:33Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:56:21Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Correct the C6 audit row: Actions was disabled, not is\n\nIt said \"GitHub Actions is disabled organization-wide\" as a standing fact.\nThat was true as of the 2026-08-29 date this row is anchored to and false\nsince GitHub Actions became the fleet''s live CI on 2026-09-02.","tree":{"sha":"a89525059022e10bcedcdb7d3bed77f5e102c5cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/a89525059022e10bcedcdb7d3bed77f5e102c5cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDY0NDQ0NjY0M2JjMmY5MTJkNTU1NTA4NmEzYWM5ZjNmZTc1Zjk0NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3","sha":"e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3"}],"sha":"644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/644446643bc2f912d5555086a3ac9f3fe75f9465"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:57:24Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:00:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Allowlist CHROME_PATH as a demo-tool path, not a posture decision\n\nThe three-state scanner caught the previous commit, correctly. `process.env.CHROME_PATH ||\nundefined` is a two-state read, and this repository forbids those in the interface tier because\nan emptied variable that inherits the unset default is how the console lost\nStrict-Transport-Security with nothing in the served headers to show it.\n\nCHROME_PATH is not that class. It is the same class as PYTHON, already allowlisted directly\nabove: it names a local executable a DEMO script launches, ships in no bundle, and grants a\nbrowser nothing. Unset and emptied both fall through to Playwright''s own downloaded browser --\nthe same behaviour, not a more permissive one -- which is exactly the test the allowlist''s own\ncomment sets for an entry.\n\nsettingOrDefault would be the wrong tool here: it REFUSES an emptied value, which would take the\ndemo down over a variable whose empty state is indistinguishable from its unset one.\n\nThe scanner''s red-proof case still passes, so the exemption did not blunt it: 6 tests, 6 pass.","tree":{"sha":"3e56c60d2fca8d22e5a0ec7c9463bb2a9ac4a9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/3e56c60d2fca8d22e5a0ec7c9463bb2a9ac4a9e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKGU0MGJkMzc5Njk4YmExOTE1NDdhOThlOThmYWY0M2NhODVlOGIwYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58","sha":"c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58"}],"sha":"e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/e40bd379698ba191547a98e98faf43ca85e8b0b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:50:25Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:00:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Honour CHROME_PATH in the console demo, so demo-selftest can run in CI\n\nCHROME_PATH is the fleet''s idiom for \"use this browser rather than the one Playwright would\ndownload\". The CI runner installs a system chromium and downloads no browser bundles, so a\nlaunch that ignores it fails with `Executable doesn''t exist at .../ms-playwright/...` and takes\ndemo-selftest down with it.\n\ncampaign-planner and cdd-sow-research both read CHROME_PATH already. This script did not, so its\ndemo-selftest could never have run in CI -- and nothing noticed, because Cloud Build never ran\nthe target: `demo-selftest` reached the job contract only in the change that is still waiting on\nan operator apply. The first execution of that target anywhere was on GitHub Actions, and it\nfailed immediately.\n\nUndefined when the variable is unset, which keeps a developer''s own Playwright browser working\nexactly as before.","tree":{"sha":"4d3a05d23f8eba39cc9d021c73e94a23b141520b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/4d3a05d23f8eba39cc9d021c73e94a23b141520b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKGMwZmVkNWU4ZGEwZTZlNDljNmY5MTg0NGRiNzc0NDM0YjE0MTVjNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5","sha":"482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5"}],"sha":"c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/c0fed5e8da0e6e49c6f91844db774434b1415c58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:21:26Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:00:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Adopt the fleet''s GitHub Actions gate, alongside the Cloud Build one\n\nPart of the fleet''s move off paid Cloud Build, which bills SGD ~3.94/day for work that calls no\nGoogle Cloud API, reads no secret and holds no deploy authority. Actions runs the same work free\non a public repository. Proved on account-takeover-investigator first: both jobs green, 138s of\nwall clock against Cloud Build''s 266s, running the same run-grc-ci in the same reviewed image.\n\nNothing about branch protection changes here. `pr-<repo> (portable-genai-ci-sg)` remains the\nonly REQUIRED check, so this reports alongside it and cannot block a merge while it is proved.\n\nGENERATED, not written: org-metadata/scripts/render-actions-callers.py emits this from the same\nci/gcp/repository-policy.json entry the Cloud Build trigger is built from, and its --check mode\nfails on drift. The 196 workflow files retired on 2026-09-01 rotted because each was maintained\nby hand; this one has no hand to rot by.","tree":{"sha":"36c0cfcee0e24be604f6fb86a4f843ec350a01be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/36c0cfcee0e24be604f6fb86a4f843ec350a01be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDQ4MmNiNzI3YTMxOTlkM2ZjYjBlMmZmY2Y3YzBmNDRhODgwOTBjZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355","sha":"3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355"}],"sha":"482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/482cb727a3199d3fcb0e2ffcf7c0f44a88090cd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T08:18:12Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:50:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump postcss from 8.5.22 to 8.5.26 in /ui\n\nBumps [postcss](https://github.com/postcss/postcss) from 8.5.22 to 8.5.26.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/postcss/postcss/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/postcss/postcss/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/postcss/postcss/compare/8.5.22...8.5.26)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: postcss\n  dependency-version: 8.5.26\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9688704b1036b4e4aa42a3d79fe057720d7b2771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/9688704b1036b4e4aa42a3d79fe057720d7b2771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9ENoAKDNiODZkN2EzMDhjZWM0ZTdlYWQ3ZDFhMGUwNGM2YTk1NTk1ZjYzNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/human-review-console/commit/2d39b425243893fdcd5b3aad0e84dd23ca695b48","sha":"2d39b425243893fdcd5b3aad0e84dd23ca695b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/2d39b425243893fdcd5b3aad0e84dd23ca695b48"}],"sha":"3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/3b86d7a308cec4e7ead7d1a0e04c6a95595f6355"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/2d39b425243893fdcd5b3aad0e84dd23ca695b48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:16:56Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:33:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Retire the GitHub Actions workflows, which had never run\n\nGitHub Actions are disabled for the whole organization\n(`enabled_repositories: \"none\"`), so every workflow file in this repository had\nnever executed and could not. The required check is the hosted Cloud Build\ntrigger, which already runs this repository''s gate, its ui-check where it has a\nUI, its terraform test, lint-gcp, and the IAP negative matrix against the\nruntime lockfile.\n\nUnrunnable configuration rots unobserved, and this had. The workflows still\npinned python 3.12 and 3.13 long after the fleet moved to 3.14, and the shared\nhard gate derived its environment prefix with a pattern that could not match any\nrepository whose prefix contains an underscore.\n\nRemoved:\n- .github/workflows/\n- the tests that asserted the contents of those files, and the test modules that\n  existed only to guard them\n- the github-actions dependabot ecosystem, which now has nothing left to pin\n\nKept, and repointed rather than deleted: every assertion that guarded something\nstill enforced. Where a test checked several things and only some were about a\nworkflow, the workflow lines were removed and the rest left standing.\n\nControl claims that cited a workflow as their evidence now name what actually\nenforces them. Where nothing does, they say so: the scheduled corpus refresh,\nthe managed release path and the promotion gate have no automated runner, which\nwas already true and is now written down.","tree":{"sha":"ab6cab1994346bf0cf9f24723aa477e4c19a512a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/ab6cab1994346bf0cf9f24723aa477e4c19a512a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/2d39b425243893fdcd5b3aad0e84dd23ca695b48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/