thub.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/211157e25904ac73ebe5c594542123fcd46d4e90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:14:43Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T13:52:20Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Record that the hydration proof now runs in CI, on this repository first\n\n`ui/scripts/assert-hydratable.mjs` is the only check that can fail on the dead-markup\ndefect -- the CSP header is byte-identical whether the console hydrates or does not --\nand it had never run in any CI. It was wired into .github/workflows/ci.yaml, and GitHub\nActions is disabled organization-wide, so the target existed and nothing ran it.\n\n`ui-check` is now in this repository''s reviewed hosted-CI job contract, with its\nnode_modules installed ahead of it, and this pull request is the canary that proves the\ncontract runs green. The pilot is this tree and no other.","tree":{"sha":"0be203ff5bfc257b81420cbada8f7924b89aac75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/0be203ff5bfc257b81420cbada8f7924b89aac75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/211157e25904ac73ebe5c594542123fcd46d4e90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","fo