hub.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/b57b2ecfb643045645697a55b86c48502c2131fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:18:34Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:18:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Move the kit pin to hex-service-kit v0.0.3 (#20)\n\nWave 1 bound this repository''s IAP transport facts to hex_service_kit.federation at v0.0.2.\nThis moves the pin to v0.0.3 so the whole fleet sits on one commons commit: portfolio-status.sh\ncheck 10 reads the LOCKFILES and fails while two pins coexist, and a shared package whose\nconsumers disagree is not one shared package.\n\nThe source needs no edit. The constants were already rebound in wave 1, and v0.0.2 to v0.0.3\nmoves no dependency: the only changes in the kit are its own version string and\nFederationPolicy.tenant_from_hosted_domain in federation.py.\n\nRelocked with org-metadata scripts/fleet-deps.py refresh, which pins the commit the annotated\ntag dereferences to (d28baa1c). No lockfile was hand-edited.\n\nGate: make check, exit 0, 392 passed.","tree":{"sha":"e89f4a0c56be0c35ed6502a808e1b25f6e5a44ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/e89f4a0c56be0c35ed6502a808e1b25f6e5a44ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/b57b2ecfb643045645697a55b86c48502c2131fd","verification":{"payload":"tree e89f4a0c56be0c35ed6502a808e1b25f6e5a44ea\nparent 39e11da0e5ad9bce01ee9983136486eb6f23a25b\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787671114 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787671114 +0800\n\nMove the kit pin to hex-service-kit v0.0.3 (#20)\n\nWave 1 bound this repository''s IAP transport facts to hex_service_kit.federation at v0.0.2.\nThis moves the pin to v0.0.3 so the whole fleet sits on one commons commit: portfolio-status.sh\ncheck 10 reads the LOCKFILES and fails while two pins coexist, and a shared package whose\nconsumers disagree is not one shared package.\n\nThe source needs no edit. The constants were already rebound in wave 1, and v0.0.2 to v0.0.3\nmoves no dependency: the only changes in the kit are its own version string and\nFederationPolicy.tenant_from_hosted_domain in federation.py.\n\nRelocked with org-metadata scripts/fleet-deps.py refresh, which pins the commit the annotated\ntag dereferences to (d28baa1c). No lockfile was hand-edited.\n\nGate: make check, exit 0, 392 passed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjbJKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnEEQAJFfjbM1HvYk/by9uMVaaRv9\nIIldp1Zt2GLaewshOpLKRdVJmxV3svUmJ9nQpjg8cBAx9RhKt9+sqZgPnGSU/LC4\nJaP76EQoMPK+G09JNPm9Zy+RoMmJA81p2Dae9Wimxnmvu/UoOFIQU/MJkrGvMUpb\nlmFxVZP2TftC/aaj36ODY6onr/9Ijkq6nmOCtj0r7B8LuoJKpoA0Zkn2p2txM9vv\n3HM8lfOGfTIA+vd2GjRXS0fMjOuoFwLvSh1VyPKJ0SPxIt3hAvZ5HVFMTQCzOcAu\nXASS4mhC2VIUt5LhwpoNDiZ3F4QeAmKmzPjJ6QJMk/CnyUJmKHQVUKy90PENqwca\nvteW61e1BCJiauAzUcwyPpzC5B2EpvjKjBauzGekYiCpBT92SY0+V3n7KRfWNual\n+uCtuRaY+ThQ/ZPpu9TEy24fpgFbiiCq3ZqK8ZmMBKz7iHNdxeMS4XyMfHtb5rVt\n0T9PRQrZthPOr2Pkb4llHzhD4XOVQA17GBir8Q5OsOOiIi+nT/