shishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/commits/39e11da0e5ad9bce01ee9983136486eb6f23a25b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:33:52Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:33:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bind the IAP transport facts to hex-service-kit v0.0.2 (#19)\n\n* Bind the IAP transport facts to the kit\n\nThe header name, the issuer and the key-set URL were declared here as literals, and the same\nthree literals are declared again in every repository that verifies an IAP assertion. That is\none security decision written down fifty-four times. They are now rebound from\nhex_service_kit.federation, so this adapter cannot drift from the reviewed set, and a test\nasserts the three values against the kit rather than against a local copy of them.\n\nPin moved to hex-service-kit v0.0.2, which is where federation lives.\n\n* Relock onto hex-service-kit v0.0.2\n\nThe lock pins the commit v0.0.2 dereferences to (e08f10ac), not the annotated tag object,\nwhich is what makes the pin installable.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bec290a4d803d1b3b7588b9491cd7517c524642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/trees/7bec290a4d803d1b3b7588b9491cd7517c524642"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/human-review-console/git/commits/39e11da0e5ad9bce01ee9983136486eb6f23a25b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bec290a4d803d1b3b7588b9491cd7517c524642\nparent 4af812df6ce82b1b09ab2a249fcb093b95b2e5f2\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787668432 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787668432 +0800\n\nBind the IAP transport facts to hex-service-kit v0.0.2 (#19)\n\n* Bind the IAP transport facts to the kit\n\nThe header name, the issuer and the key-set URL were declared here as literals, and the same\nthree literals are declared again in every repository that verifies an IAP assertion. That is\none security decision written down fifty-four times. They are now rebound from\nhex_service_kit.federation, so this adapter cannot drift from the reviewed set, and a test\nasserts the three values against the kit rather than against a local copy of them.\n\nPin moved to hex-service-kit v0.0.2, which is where federation lives.\n\n* Relock onto hex-service-kit v0.0.2\n\nThe lock pins the commit v0.0.2 dereferences to (e08f10ac), not the annotated tag object,\nwhich is what makes the pin installable.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjafQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACTIQAA2TmyhDEYx+qRqOOdhO8ut7\nTI3yJXcuSqJupX7T0g+1/YkYHR3il5K37jYTQdpA1I35pMrCiWPyQ1sye9Lcuvg5\n35qouhNYbOqiYknhSyS3frhNagYYJXEw+g7oerkpIfqCC5vUo/7Polf7FJlmMwZS\n79gQEjSiWxqTK9y27qYa5fTnSfzqdGNdYH+pRedKsCCKdTX1OlApCLodjwWyJkyI\n71XGbSNEZfJL5NgzqSkBnGz411MQRV7CroC0SMHQxAaM6ko8Nt71NhRRdoRRy7oA\nfeIlYxEW+pDJV/WMY6nO1QGjOXo4PNqyp