/fca2b141584c8070bc4cafb54d61aa1efd9b0955"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/commits/2568c156e40de719366c98f9bc2ac6f2800406fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:17:28Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:33:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Retire the GitHub Actions workflows, which had never run\n\nGitHub Actions are disabled for the whole organization\n(`enabled_repositories: \"none\"`), so every workflow file in this repository had\nnever executed and could not. The required check is the hosted Cloud Build\ntrigger, which already runs this repository''s gate, its ui-check where it has a\nUI, its terraform test, lint-gcp, and the IAP negative matrix against the\nruntime lockfile.\n\nUnrunnable configuration rots unobserved, and this had. The workflows still\npinned python 3.12 and 3.13 long after the fleet moved to 3.14, and the shared\nhard gate derived its environment prefix with a pattern that could not match any\nrepository whose prefix contains an underscore.\n\nRemoved:\n- .github/workflows/\n- the tests that asserted the contents of those files, and the test modules that\n  existed only to guard them\n- the github-actions dependabot ecosystem, which now has nothing left to pin\n\nKept, and repointed rather than deleted: every assertion that guarded something\nstill enforced. Where a test checked several things and only some were about a\nworkflow, the workflow lines were removed and the rest left standing.\n\nControl claims that cited a workflow as their evidence now name what actually\nenforces them. Where nothing does, they say so: the scheduled corpus refresh,\nthe managed release path and the promotion gate have no automated runner, which\nwas already true and is now written down.","tree":{"sha":"6371c49cc67993b3e2e5f87ee2f9e4c779a199ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/trees/6371c49cc67993b3e2e5f87ee2f9e4c779a199ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/commits/2568c156e40de719366c98f9bc2ac6f2800406fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.git