@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cite the recorded residency decision instead of an open choice (#24)\n\nSection 2 offered three equal options and left the choice unmade, owned by\nthe security owner. The catalog now records it: the launch set co-locates in\nasia-southeast1, which this repo already pins, and anything outside it is an\nexception needing the service named, the reason, a data-flow record and\napproval.\n\nWhat the record deliberately does not assert is carried across rather than\ndropped: it does not claim every managed service Doc1 binds is available in\nasia-southeast1, so the per-service availability check becomes a named\npre-apply step. Sign-off stays with the security owner; it is now sign-off\non a recorded position rather than the discovery of an unmade choice.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"342e5d66a5d8533d0c88bb11c4bb0c52638a02f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/trees/342e5d66a5d8533d0c88bb11c4bb0c52638a02f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/commits/c74a05143dc9bbd79d145c58b21a91f721809522","verification":{"payload":"tree 342e5d66a5d8533d0c88bb11c4bb0c52638a02f2\nparent 10c3d92028d13fabbcccdc6141d7670c022f8c0e\nauthor Ashish <ashish.awasthi@gmail.com> 1787518883 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787518883 +0800\n\nCite the recorded residency decision instead of an open choice (#24)\n\nSection 2 offered three equal options and left the choice unmade, owned by\nthe security owner. The catalog now records it: the launch set co-locates in\nasia-southeast1, which this repo already pins, and anything outside it is an\nexception needing the service named, the reason, a data-flow record and\napproval.\n\nWhat the record deliberately does not assert is carried across rather than\ndropped: it does not claim every managed service Doc1 binds is available in\nasia-southeast1, so the per-service availability check becomes a named\npre-apply step. Sign-off stays with the security owner; it is now sign-off\non a recorded position rather than the discovery of an unmade choice.\n\nCo-authored-by: Ashish Awasthi <72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqi1+jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8mkQAJyGaUabcR731Q/DNV5tQtgQ\nP0ukcPPlZszgPmh0qHpzGpCwkHB1uYZq5+FEWTlfWKcUb99HLUUNB6dHmDes8ZtL\nQQaxdshHk/1y/BVtHohedgpJ4ZH4kHYuRbe4gFNE2jTaDUDd+csQhBvSrRHTf3Xn\nmZxWjAm9dkmauCGfJOZnH+AB56ICjjeW80lhokCA2i+iA8fsTF6w92ChvQTXC1Po\nroCm/kKGqXkOiWE5C7FV4e7FS+BS80P9WYipC6POJtxoVHnaoBLmTz29I9gqwbxm\ngE4yDLjD/TJWgkVZsVwgucM/FulzZuqLslB0V7Wzdd2f2ZGR9H/1DxwLB+hVFXFc\nHFhtV61D80uYH8JTYnuJNIU6czUr1dGUVoWTzBmy7qgPNZhXF42V/2TNvDdJ34xS\n11ruUKmHYbcvEWLfVGGXHIl3mIjsu+4mb3U8PQut/u6FzgTRtzq1NutRrNOyZIXF\nrNJATurtezi0sRqUk2PjqghCvbgKPhpMVzpVj7docP2PFjAX2OmPm0guygzPJDLV\nCyeNvBLzZjs7Q9wIVGGxweNNucEMGSqx/icYSFvD5/Y7XkCt44wPApLGVTO1uKwt\n6d1AR+xwNZcZv5AcMfzawBMcU5yZHRxAdvCf1pw8kRANb4eJzgA5iVqBmNHdy0u0\nmba01jKBa6vtGHre3Gnj\n=Cr8h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T21:01:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user