,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/commits/b6c0efe303b5c59f82a9d4b7dc432600cc5b1542/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:15:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T02:15:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"message":"Give both portal shells a favicon\n\nThe RM and Ops shells are the only surfaces a browser shows a tab for.\nThe 47 agent consoles render inside the portal''s iframes, where the host\npage''s icon is the one the user sees, so they are left alone.\n\nThe two shells need different mechanisms. Next.js App Router picks up\napp/favicon.ico and app/apple-icon.png by file convention and injects the\nlink tags itself, so ui-rm''s layout.tsx is untouched. Angular has no such\nconvention: ui-ops gets a public/ directory in the asset glob and two\nexplicit links in index.html. Those hrefs are relative, matching\nAngular''s own default, so the shell survives being served under a path\nprefix where a root-absolute /favicon.ico would resolve past it.\n\nBoth paths were verified through the production static server rather than\nthe dev server: a missing file there returns 200 text/html from the SPA\nfallback, so status code proves nothing and content-type is the check.","tree":{"sha":"9e729361afd8dc9fb03a9ebb3885f678ab7b3580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/trees/9e729361afd8dc9fb03a9ebb3885f678ab7b3580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/git/commits/b6c0efe303b5c59f82a9d4b7dc432600cc5b1542","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/journey-portal/commit/b6c0efe303b5c59f82a9d4b7dc432600cc5b1542","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh9WNoAKGI2YzBlZmUzMDNiNWM1OWY4MmE5ZDRiN2RjNDMyNjAwY2M1YjE1NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/journey-portal/commit/20ca5ea6d3d2fbddae0e6025dbf1ac8203cdd6c2","sha":"20ca5ea6d3d2fbddae0e6025dbf1ac8203cdd6c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/journey-portal/commits/20ca5e