users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/151ea17c8e914dc33033726a3c4c1b98eef2bb2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:04:51Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:25:43Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen the generated variants, not only the summary\n\nThe headline, body and CTA the model writes are the deliverable, and they went\nback to the caller, and the headline into the image model''s prompt, without\nModel Armor ever seeing them: the OUTPUT screen covered only the narrated\nsummary. The deterministic brand, claim and policy checks are not a substitute\nfor the injection, sensitive-data and malicious-URI screen.\n\nEvery variant''s model-written fields are now screened as OUTPUT straight after\ngeneration and dedup, before an image prompt is built from a headline and\nbefore the result is assembled. A blocked variant raises and leaves a BLOCKED\naudit record, as a blocked summary already did.\n\nFound by the second-reader review of the fail-closed verdict fixes. Both new\ntests fail with the service change reverted; make gate green.","tree":{"sha":"4855d9c1e148603eae0477a4a87203d44c26f0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/4855d9c1e148603eae0477a4a87203d44c26f0a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/151ea17c8e914dc33033726a3c4c1b98eef2bb2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fals