.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/05a4faca969f703f55e449854ef872f84d0ab347/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:21Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:17:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"c6cffb6f0916c348cf8bc1e535ad4e3a0c64b038","url":"htt