//api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/693ad13ac53a057a90cbda6d1062dba4bf2592bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:21:15Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T12:26:19Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Model Armor: allow only a complete, clean screen, and fail closed otherwise\n\nThe REST verdict mapping was\n  allowed = match_state != \"MATCH_FOUND\" if match_state is not None else not findings\nwhich failed OPEN three ways: an UNSPECIFIED or unknown filterMatchState was \"not\nMATCH_FOUND\"; a missing or empty sanitizationResult had no findings, so \"not findings\"\nallowed; and invocationResult was never read, so NO_MATCH_FOUND with PARTIAL or FAILURE\n(filters skipped, e.g. a prompt padded past the prompt-injection filter''s token limit)\npassed text that was never screened.\n\nThe verdict now allows ONLY filterMatchState == \"NO_MATCH_FOUND\" with invocationResult ==\n\"SUCCESS\", compared as the exact enum names the proto3 JSON mapping sends. Everything else\nblocks with sanitized_text None. HTTP errors and timeouts still propagate, and the call''s\ndeadline is now model_armor.timeout_seconds (10s) instead of a hard-coded 30s.\n\nThe new unit test has two halves. The SDK-free half builds REST bodies from stdlib enums\nmirroring FilterMatchState and InvocationResult and screens them through screen() with a\nfake HTTP client, so it runs in CI''s SDK-free make test. The real-SDK half renders real\nmodelarmor_v1 messages to JSON as the REST API sends them, pins the mirror enums and the\nmirror wire shape to the real ones, and skips where google-cloud-modelarmor is absent.\nAgainst the old mapping, 30 SDK-free cases fail, and 42 fail with the SDK installed.","tree":{"sha":"9561925560734d70aa8a4c3ef6d902371e3d9a31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/9561925560734d70aa8a4c3ef6d902371e3d9a31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/693ad13ac53a057a90cbda6d1062dba4bf2592bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/693ad13ac53a057a90cbda6d1062dba4bf2592bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDY5M2FkMTNhYzUzYTA1N2E5MGNiZGE2ZDEwNjJkYmE0YmYyNTkyYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa","sha":"30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa"}],"sha":"693ad13ac53a057a90cbda6d1062dba4bf2592bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/693ad13ac53a057a90cbda6d1062dba4bf2592bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:14:33Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T10:19:25Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Retire the hand-written Cloud Trace tracer onto the kit''s build_tracer\n\nThe gcp tracer was a CloudTraceSpanExporter written in this repository. It\nexported straight to Cloud Trace, so every span went around the\nagent-observability collector, which is where GenAI content attributes are\ndeleted. It now delegates to hex_service_kit.tracing.build_tracer: OTLP to\nthe collector named by OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT and nowhere else, with the\nID token the private collector requires, under service.name set to this\nrepository. Under the kit''s decision D1 the tracer refuses to build when the\nendpoint is unset or empty, so a gcp deployment without the collector wired\nfails on its first span instead of exporting around the redaction.\n\nThe adapter moves to adapters/gcp/tracer.py as CloudTracerAdapter, the name\nand shape the rendered template repositories already use, and settings.yaml\nbinds it under gcp and platform.\n\nThe gcp extra drops opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and declares the kit\ntracer''s runtime directly (the OTLP/HTTP exporter, requests, google-auth).\nIt does not take hex-service-kit[otel]: that extra floors\nopentelemetry-sdk at 1.44, and google-adk caps it at 1.42.1, so the\ncombination does not resolve. The kit''s tracer runs on either SDK.\n\nRelocked with scripts/lock.py (this repository has no lock target). Beyond the removed Cloud Trace exporter and its\ngoogle-cloud-trace dependency, uv collapsed some python-version markers;\nno package version changes on the 3.14 interpreter CI and the image use.\n\nDocs that said spans go to Cloud Trace now say they go through the collector.\n\nPart of phase P4 of org-metadata''s guardrail/registry/observability plan.","tree":{"sha":"a3d39a859284d50fc4eacfb7fed55448b5efd5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/a3d39a859284d50fc4eacfb7fed55448b5efd5fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDMwMTg0NjgyZDU2ZWEyMjEzNDVmZTdlNDYwZTg0MGY2NmUzMjhhZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/edfdabd325f77fc77aff74a1abfe5aad82b9686e","sha":"edfdabd325f77fc77aff74a1abfe5aad82b9686e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/edfdabd325f77fc77aff74a1abfe5aad82b9686e"}],"sha":"30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/30184682d56ea221345fe7e460e840f66e328afa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/edfdabd325f77fc77aff74a1abfe5aad82b9686e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:41:09Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:53:40Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nhex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724): the kit''s build_tracer now refuses an unset\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT (decision D1). This repository does not call it, so the\nchange is the pin alone, plus opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace leaving the kit''s otel\nextra (this repository declares its own where it needs one).\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 32\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"faf4c85927c91c5baa9be2c2555a431510068434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees