":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/9540acc874c42a9d3018891d8e939ec66fc37afd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:59:09Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:02:21Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the answering model as pills, and sample per call\n\nBump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10 and install its answer provenance on the\nAPI, so every model-backed response names the model that answered in\nX-Answered-By. The Gemini copy adapter, the File Search retrieval call and\nthe Imagen adapter note the model they called; the offline stub notes\ndeterministic-offline-stub, the same string generator_model reports; the\nlive adapter relies on the kit client. No call attaches an online search\ntool (File Search reads this deployment''s own corpus), so none notes one.\n\nReplace the full-width provenance banner with two top-right pills fed by\n/healthz and one window.fetch wrapper that reads both headers.\n\nTemperature is now optional and omitted when None. Drafting (variants,\nnarration, the ADK agent) samples freely; classification and File Search\nretrieval stay pinned at 0.0. Delete use_hard_reasoning, which the adapter\nnever read.","tree":{"sha":"bb877bb2144aa497b26ec39429f87a86be32c8e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/bb877bb2144aa497b26ec39429f87a86be32c8e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/9540acc874c42a9d3018891d8e939ec66fc37afd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/9540acc874c42a9d3018891d8e939ec66fc37afd","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDk1NDBhY2M4NzRjNDJhOWQzMDE4ODkxZDhlOTM5ZWM2NmZjMzdhZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced","sha":"4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced"}],"sha":"9540acc874c42a9d3018891d8e939ec66fc37afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/9540acc874c42a9d3018891d8e939ec66fc37afd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:33:17Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:38:21Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Add the live laptop profile: the copy port on the shared local model\n\nMKT_CREATIVE_PROFILE=live binds every port to the same offline adapter\nlocal does, except copy, which now calls the fleet''s one local\nopen-weight model through hex_service_kit.localmodel (kit v0.0.9).\nVariant drafts and narration are schema-validated and retried by the\nkit client; responses record the model id that answered.\n\nimage stays on the deterministic stub under live: a local open-weight\ntext model cannot draw, so only text generation moves to the model.\n\nlive keeps the laptop posture: seeded personas, localhost CORS origins,\nthe loopback exposure guard and in-process stores. The banner names the\nlocal model. A down model server is a 503, an answer that never\nvalidates a 502. local stays the profile tests, CI and make demo use.","tree":{"sha":"ebba3f33c18300f4bbdb303d9ea7133e36189afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/ebba3f33c18300f4bbdb303d9ea7133e36189afc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/4caea4d5c056bb44e02b20f21808d087fd699ced","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDRjYWVhNGQ1YzA1NmJiNDRlMDJiMjBmMjE4MDhkMDg3ZmQ2OTljZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0","sha":"b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portab