ns them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- google-adk 2.8.0->2.9.0\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7\n- tzlocal 5.4.4->None (transitive)","tree":{"sha":"9f081bc6711219509f00ae61f09ed0e5c3c3b58d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/9f081bc6711219509f00ae61f09ed0e5c3c3b58d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKGIxNWFjMTU0Y2QyYzUyMmY3Zjk0NjAzNDZhN2JiYTdkMjQxMjVmYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/f77b02e2a1f3fd8b3a5a8ab67a344eb419530551","sha":"f77b02e2a1f3fd8b3a5a8ab67a344eb419530551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/f77b02e2a1f3fd8b3a5a8ab67a344eb419530551"}],"sha":"b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/b15ac154cd2c522f7f9460346a7bba7d24125fb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/f77b02e2a1f3fd8b3a5a8ab67a344eb419530551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:07:21Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:11:06Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Switch the guardrail and review routing, and report every hand-off\n\nSlice 3 of the rebuild entry, platform shape: the fleet''s runtime-control contract for the\ntwo cheap controls this service has. It has no PII redaction port, so it gains no redaction\nswitch and no input_redacted disclosure.\n\n- MKT_CREATIVE_GUARDRAIL and MKT_CREATIVE_REVIEW_ROUTING are read once at settings load in\n  three states: unset is on, a boolean wins, emptied or unrecognised refuses at boot. Off\n  binds a disabled adapter from adapters/controls.py and logs one warning per process.\n- Under gcp or platform, routing on with no HUMAN_REVIEW_URL refuses at boot, where every\n  hand-off used to fail silently behind the studio service''s contextlib.suppress. Under gcp,\n  the Model Armor guardrail on with an empty template refuses at boot rather than building a\n  malformed URL at the first request.\n- The API route, the agent tool, the MCP generate_creative tool and the CLI hand off through\n  RecordingReviewRouter, so each says what happened (routed, failed, off, not_required) and a\n  failure is logged by exception type. The console states the outcome in plain words.\n- Terraform sets both switches on the Cloud Run service and names the console, which it did\n  not before: a gcp deploy of this change would otherwise refuse to boot. human_review_url\n  is required while routing is on, so the stack now needs Terraform 1.9.\n- The runbook documents the switches and the new boot refusal; the R8 control row says a\n  deployment can switch routing off and that every caller reports it.","tree":{"sha":"7d8ddc14ddfc45024913510fbd52768e81a9318b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/7d8ddc14ddfc45024913510fbd52768e81a9318b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/f77b02e2a1f3fd8b3a5a8ab67a344eb419530551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.