/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/3e88438dcbfc9ce3a2b3ce3bef3d7c908d1e646e","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDNlODg0MzhkY2JmYzljZTNhMmIzY2UzYmVmM2Q3YzkwOGQxZTY0NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/a2e418774317be451dd5fec501e24c620b03592d","sha":"a2e418774317be451dd5fec501e24c620b03592d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/a2e418774317be451dd5fec501e24c620b03592d"}],"sha":"3e88438dcbfc9ce3a2b3ce3bef3d7c908d1e646e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/3e88438dcbfc9ce3a2b3ce3bef3d7c908d1e646e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/a2e418774317be451dd5fec501e24c620b03592d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:48:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T16:54:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Judge the copy, score the image port, and give every bar a rubric\n\nTwo gaps, and both are the same shape: the thing this service exists to produce\nwas the thing nothing measured.\n\nThe copy is now judged. brand_safety_detection feeds the studio a deliberately\nbad variant and checks it is flagged, which proves the detector fires and says\nnothing about whether the copy the studio actually writes is any good. The\ngolden set carried no expected outputs at all. Bad copy that is brand-safe is\nwhat gets published: a variant can pass every rule in the pack and still make an\nunsubstantiated superlative claim, promise something the product does not do, or\nend on a call to action that names no action. None of those is unsafe, all three\nare wrong, and only a judgement catches them. eval/run_narrative_eval.py grades\nthem against a model-risk floor in config/quality-floors.toml.\n\nThe image port is now scored. ImageGenerationPort is the only image port in the\nfleet and had zero eval coverage: nothing checked that the asset came back at the\ndimensions asked for, with alt text, or with provenance. All four matter for a\nmarketing asset and the last two reach a person directly, since an image with no\nalt text fails accessibility outright. image_spec_compliance scores all four at\n1.0, through the adapter the CONTAINER binds rather than a stub written in the\neval, so the managed Imagen path is measured by the same rule. The bar is 1.0\nbecause at 0.75 a single missing field would pass, and the red case is one asset\ncarrying the three failures that happen together.\n\nThresholds now have one home. The THRESHOLDS dict is gone; every bar is read from\neval/rubrics/*.yaml, and assert_covers fails the build in both directions. Three\nof the five metrics had no rubric at all.\n\ndocs/evals.md is generated from the rubrics, the corpora and the floors, with\n--check in `make gate`. Pin: agent-eval-kit v0.0.2. practices-audit gains E4/E5.\n\nVerified: `make gate` green end to end (421 passed, eval PASS, narrative PASS).","tree":{"sha":"1a761e5d088031d08c4d70407c6005d2fbac78ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/1a761e5d088031d08c4d70407c6005d2fbac78ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/a2e418774317be451dd5fec501e24c620b03592d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","recei