gin":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/6814f08764a6be467dc18f49dd252a77c6b0a423/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:54:34Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:22:14Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4 in /ui in the npm-minor-patch group\n\nBumps the npm-minor-patch group in /ui with 1 update: [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js).\n\n\nUpdates `next` from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.4)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"29699e03e34721451b185c5e6d8650e660d04951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/29699e03e34721451b185c5e6d8650e660d04951"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/6814f08764a6be467dc18f49dd252a77c6b0a423","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/6814f08764a6be467dc18f49dd252a77c6b0a423","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKDY4MTRmMDg3NjRhNmJlNDY3ZGMxOGY0OWRkMjUyYTc3YzZiMGE0MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d","sha":"e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d"}],"sha":"6814f08764a6be467dc18f49dd252a77c6b0a423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/6814f08764a6be467dc18f49dd252a77c6b0a423"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T00:05:58Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T00:17:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Render the provenance banner this console has never shown\n\nThe strip naming WHERE the runtime sits and WHICH model answers (org decision,\n2026-08-30) has never appeared in this console -- not standalone, not embedded,\nnot once since it landed. Two defects, stacked, and both fail as an absence.\n\nThe banner fetched `/api/agent/healthz`, the same-origin route handler the\nservice template ships. This console has no such handler; it calls its backend\ndirectly on NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE. So the health call reached a path nothing\nserves, and the one documented behaviour on a failed health call is to render\nnothing -- deliberately, because a banner that guessed would assert provenance\nit does not have. A check that cannot fail loudly fails invisibly. It now reads\nthe same base the rest of the console reads, which is also what makes it\nreachable: `connect-src` is built from that value, and the service''s CORS\nallowlist already has to admit it for every other call.\n\nFixing the fetch alone still put nothing on a page. `.provenance-banner` carried\n`margin: -32px -18px 20px`, which reaches the viewport edge by cancelling the\n`padding: 32px 18px` that the plain-CSS consoles set on `body`. This console\nsets no body padding, so those numbers hoisted the strip 32px ABOVE the\nviewport: in the DOM on every page load, visible on none.\n\nBoth halves are now pinned in tests/unit/test_provenance_banner_contract.py as\nagreement rather than literals -- the banner names the proxy exactly when the\ntree has one, and whatever it pulls up by, the host must give back -- so the\nassertions stay true under either console shape rather than freezing this one.\n\nVerified by running it: the banner reads \"running locally · model\ndeterministic-offline-stub\" standalone and through the portal mount, and\njourney-portal''s `make e2e-apps-local` sweep reaches 20/20 with no broken\nrequests, having been red on exactly the eight consoles with this defect.","tree":{"sha":"4d6c195ed50cc9f1b859906ea6e9d64d606c02ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/4d6c195ed50cc9f1b859906ea6e9d64d606c02ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKGU3YzAxMGI3NjdmYzM3OGM1YjgxMmVkMjQ4Njk1ZDgwODgzNzQ1MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692","sha":"ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692"}],"sha":"e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/e7c010b767fc378c5b812ed248695d808837452d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:58:49Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T01:07:36Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the triage model the settings actually pin\n\nThe module docstrings said triage/classification uses `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`.\nThat was false on two counts:\n\n- `config/settings.yaml` pins `triage: gemini-3.5-flash`. The prose described a\n  pin that no longer exists: the 2026-08-27 in-region sweep changed the settings\n  and left the docstrings behind.\n- `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` commits ML processing to the `us` and `eu`\n  multi-regions only (verified against the publisher 2026-09-03), so it cannot\n  serve a deployment whose `models.location` defaults to `asia-southeast1`.\n  See org-metadata/docs/gcp-service-region-availability.md for the region table.","tree":{"sha":"6b99586f6752a4d88de61bc57acc6123439e16e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/6b99586f6752a4d88de61bc57acc6123439e16e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKGFkN2UyYzhlZWFiN2FjMmJhM2EwNjkyN2Q2MWFjZDgwZjFlYjY2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2","sha":"cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2"}],"sha":"ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/ad7e2c8eeab7ac2ba3a06927d61acd80f1eb6692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:20:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:43:32Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Adopt the fleet''s GitHub Actions gate, alongside the Cloud Build one\n\nPart of the fleet''s move off paid Cloud Build, which bills SGD ~3.94/day for work that calls no\nGoogle Cloud API, reads no secret and holds no deploy authority. Actions runs the same work free\non a public repository. Proved on account-takeover-investigator first: both jobs green, 138s of\nwall clock against Cloud Build''s 266s, running the same run-grc-ci in the same reviewed image.\n\nNothing about branch protection changes here. `pr-<repo> (portable-genai-ci-sg)` remains the\nonly REQUIRED check, so this reports alongside it and cannot block a merge while it is proved.\n\nGENERATED, not written: org-metadata/scripts/render-actions-callers.py emits this from the same\nci/gcp/repository-policy.json entry the Cloud Build trigger is built from, and its --check mode\nfails on drift. The 196 workflow files retired on 2026-09-01 rotted because each was maintained\nby hand; this one has no hand to rot by.","tree":{"sha":"c6ae7f217eda6775aa8e5d639e670487f916a99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/c6ae7f217eda6775aa8e5d639e670487f916a99f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKGNkY2U3MGU1MWNhMzc4YmFiZmI3ZTg4MDc3ZDFjNDllNmJiMjQzYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044","sha":"d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044"}],"sha":"cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/cdce70e51ca378babfb7e88077d1c49e6bb243a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:15:33Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:31:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Retire the GitHub Actions workflows, which had never run\n\nGitHub Actions are disabled for the whole organization\n(`enabled_repositories: \"none\"`), so every workflow file in this repository had\nnever executed and could not. The required check is the hosted Cloud Build\ntrigger, which already runs this repository''s gate, its ui-check where it has a\nUI, its terraform test, lint-gcp, and the IAP negative matrix against the\nruntime lockfile.\n\nUnrunnable configuration rots unobserved, and this had. The workflows still\npinned python 3.12 and 3.13 long after the fleet moved to 3.14, and the shared\nhard gate derived its environment prefix with a pattern that could not match any\nrepository whose prefix contains an underscore.\n\nRemoved:\n- .github/workflows/\n- the tests that asserted the contents of those files, and the test modules that\n  existed only to guard them\n- the github-actions dependabot ecosystem, which now has nothing left to pin\n\nKept, and repointed rather than deleted: every assertion that guarded something\nstill enforced. Where a test checked several things and only some were about a\nworkflow, the workflow lines were removed and the rest left standing.\n\nControl claims that cited a workflow as their evidence now name what actually\nenforces them. Where nothing does, they say so: the scheduled corpus refresh,\nthe managed release path and the promotion gate have no automated runner, which\nwas already true and is now written down.","tree":{"sha":"76d3e89fd0862c4bbfbcea7d40752e7d7dd3406d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/76d3e89fd0862c4bbfbcea7d40752e7d7dd3406d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh-TdoAKGQwNDZmNGYxZjYzYTA5MGQ0Nzg4NGUxZTE5OWJjNmY4ZjZkYzEwNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/creative-studio/commit/57ea2ee9a36a95b09de004b6f415e6e15d3c42f4","sha":"57ea2ee9a36a95b09de004b6f415e6e15d3c42f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/57ea2ee9a36a95b09de004b6f415e6e15d3c42f4"}],"sha":"d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/d046f4f1f63a090d47884e1e199bc6f8f6dc1044"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/commits/57ea2ee9a36a95b09de004b6f415e6e15d3c42f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:51:40Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:55:20Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump the python-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 2 updates\n\nBumps the python-minor-patch group with 2 updates in the / directory: [google-adk](https://github.com/google/adk-python) and [ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff).\n\n\nUpdates `google-adk` from 2.7.1 to 2.8.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/google/adk-python/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/google/adk-python/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/google/adk-python/compare/v2.7.1...v2.8.0)\n\nUpdates `ruff` from 0.16.3 to 0.16.5\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/compare/0.16.3...0.16.5)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: google-adk\n  dependency-version: 2.8.0\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n  dependency-group: python-minor-patch\n- dependency-name: ruff\n  dependency-version: 0.16.5\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: python-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"875dba4be40aa6223a557d3edd7b1794e7af6318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/trees/875dba4be40aa6223a557d3edd7b1794e7af6318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/creative-studio/git/commits/57ea2ee9a36a95b09de004b6f415e6e15d3c42f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ash