per call\n\n- Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.10 and install_answer_provenance(app), so every\n  response names the model that answered (X-Answered-By) and whether it searched\n  (X-Search-Used).\n- The Gemini and local narrators note their model; the live one is noted by the\n  kit client. No adapter attaches a search tool, so none notes search.\n- LlmRequest.temperature is float | None = None and the Gemini adapter omits it\n  when None. The one call site (handover narration) is drafting, so it is free.\n- generator_model no longer honours use_hard_reasoning: it names the model the\n  adapter calls.\n- ModelPills (top right) replaces ProvenanceBanner; the proxy forwards both\n  answer headers.","tree":{"sha":"aba68e4ee2727b9db8e4c88490dcf9dcf22ee472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/trees/aba68e4ee2727b9db8e4c88490dcf9dcf22ee472"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/commits/26e138be142f4814f13c0c434d3aad3946dd15b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashish