ayload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commit/b6733fb2ac51e755247651e093e1a01c838e8447","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_YdoAKGI2NzMzZmIyYWM1MWU3NTUyNDc2NTFlMDkzZTFhMDFjODM4ZTg0NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commit/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba","sha":"6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba"}],"sha":"b6733fb2ac51e755247651e093e1a01c838e8447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/b6733fb2ac51e755247651e093e1a01c838e8447"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:35:30Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:48:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Window the ops feed on the handover''s own date, and create the dataset it reads\n\nThree defects, none visible to a green offline gate, because the offline adapter took\nthe last N ROWS of a file and never looked at a date.\n\nThe window was measured from a wall clock and the request''s own date was thrown away.\nHandoverRequest carries as_of and lookback_days; handover_service passed only the\nlookback to the port, and the managed adapter filled the gap with\nas_of >= DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE(), INTERVAL @lookback DAY). So a handover written for\nany date but today read the wrong window while its heading reported the requested one,\ndomain/acknowledgement.py says in as many words that the as-of is an input and never a\nclock read here, and the shipped book, pinned to 2026-08-07, would have returned nothing\nat all on a deployment: an empty handover pack with nothing red anywhere. The port takes\nthe date now and both stores window on it, so the offline gate stays byte-identical, a\ndemo asks the deployment for the book''s own date, and production asks for today''s.\n\nThe dataset did not exist. Nothing in infra/terraform/ created it, no API enabled it, no\nIAM role named BigQuery and no CMEK bound it. All five arrive together.\n\nThe dataset was hardcoded anyway. _TABLES named ops_worklist.<table> in the module,\ndirectly under a comment saying a deployment overrides the dataset via settings. There\nwas no such setting; there is now, three-state, and an empty one makes the adapter\nrefuse rather than return an empty series.\n\nThe rows move from fixtures/ops_worklist/, which only the offline adapter read, to\nsrc/control_room_handover/data/demo_book/, which both stores serve. The JSON-schema\ndrift guard follows them, so the consumed contract is now held against the rows the\ndeployment actually gets. aging, sla and source stay nested: RECORDs in BigQuery,\nSTRUCTs in DuckDB, plain dicts out of both, so the shared parser needs no branch.\n\nThe managed refusal for this port moves from ImportError to RuntimeError, because the\nconfiguration check now runs before the lazy SDK import: an operator reading an\nImportError goes looking for a missing wheel rather than a missing variable.\n\nGate green: 488 tests, eval 1.000 on all three metrics, terraform validate and 14\nterraform tests, docs, demo self-test 8 steps. The clock guard was watched failing\nagainst the shipped query and the schema guard against a dropped aging bucket.","tree":{"sha":"763e868656259fc7d28dfb0f45dac6b3689906a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/trees/763e868656259fc7d28dfb0f45dac6b3689906a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/commits/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commit/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba","node_id":"C_kwDOUAh_YdoAKDYwMzhkYWY0OTdlNWE4MGQ3YTAxYzA2Nzk3NzcwMDU0NzA0N2NkYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commit/d5b2f0b7219b2fc980b58c03c5c788ace6b2962f","sha":"d5b2f0b7219b2fc980b58c03c5c788ace6b2962f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/d5b2f0b7219b2fc980b58c03c5c788ace6b2962f"}],"sha":"6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/6038daf497e5a80d7a01c067977700547047cdba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/commits/d5b2f0b7219b2fc980b58c03c5c788ace6b2962f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:14Z","email":"72717+ashishawasthi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:38:22Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"1ef3537e475ab10283170cc8b5e5ed10fa05410b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/trees/1ef3537e475ab10283170cc8b5e5ed10fa05410b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/control-room-handover/git/commits/d5b2f0b7219b2fc980b58c03c5c788ace6b2962f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us